                'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Sales Pricing Structure & Determination Matrix. Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-039.',
                'content' => '
<h2>1. Document Information</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
    <tbody>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">Document ID</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-04</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Document Name</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Sales Pricing Structure (Engine)</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sales & Distribution / Pricing Engine</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-04 (Sales Pricing Structure)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
<p class="mb-2">Sales Pricing Engine merupakan komponen inti kalkulasi yang menentukan nilai akhir pendapatan (Revenue) perusahaan per baris transaksi penjualan (Sales Order). Berbekal logika <strong>Condition Technique</strong>, *Engine* menelusuri rentetan hirarki kondisi secara dinamis untuk menyusun Base Price, Customer Discount, Freight, hingga menghitung Dasar Pengenaan Pajak (DPP), dan Pajak Keluaran (Output Tax). Sistem ini juga ditugaskan menarik data HPP (Cost/VPRS) guna menyajikan kalkulasi <em>Profit Margin</em> secara <em>real-time</em> bagi divisi Sales.</p>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold italic bg-yellow-50 p-2 border-l-4 border-yellow-500">Disclaimer: Perhitungan Profit Margin di sini bersifat estimasi operasional (untuk keputusan Sales Manager) dan tidak menggantikan margin final akuntansi yang ditentukan setelah proses Goods Issue, valuasi persediaan, dan posting keuangan selesai.</p>

<h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li>Blueprint: BP-SD-04</li>
    <li>Pricing Blueprint: PB-01 (Master Configuration)</li>
    <li>BRD: BRD-04</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Use Case</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm">
    <li><strong>UC-01 Setup Condition Master:</strong> Pricing Admin mengatur harga jual, diskon khusus pelanggan, atau ongkos kirim ke dalam tabel master dengan batasan validitas.</li>
    <li><strong>UC-02 Calculate Sales Price:</strong> Saat <em>Sales Staff</em> membuat Quotation/SO, <em>Engine</em> otomatis mengakumulasi komponen harga sesuai <em>Sales Organization</em> terkait.</li>
    <li><strong>UC-03 Manual Override:</strong> <em>Sales Staff</em> memberikan diskon tambahan manual (untuk kondisi <em>Manual = Yes</em>) tanpa mengacaukan harga sistemik.</li>
    <li><strong>UC-04 Recalculate Price:</strong> Pengguna memicu aksi "Update Pricing" untuk menarik referensi master harga terbaru tanpa perlu input ulang baris barang.</li>
    <li><strong>UC-05 Copy Pricing:</strong> Sistem mewariskan hasil kalkulasi harga utuh (Copy) saat mengkonversi dokumen, misal dari Quotation menjadi Sales Order.</li>
    <li><strong>UC-06 Simulate Pricing:</strong> <em>Engine</em> dipanggil murni untuk simulasi (saat negosiasi pelanggan) tanpa menyimpan *Condition Records* ke dalam <em>database</em> dokumen.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Functional Flow (Engine Execution)</h2>
<pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono leading-relaxed" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
Receive Request (SO Item)
↓
Determine Pricing Procedure (by Sales Area & Customer Group)
↓
Load Procedure Steps (from 10 to 110)
↓
Load Condition Records via Access Sequence (e.g., Cust.Price -> Base Price)
↓
Evaluate Condition Exclusion (Eliminasi Diskon Bertabrakan)
↓
Currency Conversion (Based on SO Document Currency)
↓
Evaluate Formulas (Amount, Percentage, or Quantity based)
↓
Fetch Internal Cost (VPRS) for Margin Calculation
↓
Calculate Subtotals (Cascading)
↓
Calculate Output Tax (On top of Tax Base / DPP)
↓
Round Values
↓
Store Document Pricing Lines
↓
Return JSON Result to UI
</pre>

<h2>6. Screen Specification</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm">
    <li><strong>Condition Record Maintenance:</strong> Form masukan tabular harga berdasar kombinasi akses (Customer+Material, atau sekadar Material). Terdiri atas nilai, <em>Valid From</em>, <em>Valid To</em>, Mata Uang, dan <em>Unit of Measure</em>.</li>
    <li><strong>SO Item Pricing Tab:</strong> Layar *read-only* (dan sebagian *editable* khusus diskon) di dalam modul SO. Menampilkan struktur harga: Step, Nama Kondisi, Nominal, Mata Uang, dan Kolom Subtotal. <strong>Terdapat satu baris khusus (Profit Margin) di paling bawah.</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Pricing Analysis:</strong> <em>Pop-up</em> modal investigasi saat <em>User</em> bertanya "Dari mana harga ini berasal?". Kolom yang ditampilkan:
        <table class="mt-2 min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs">
            <thead class="bg-gray-100">
                <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1">Kolom</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Keterangan</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Condition Status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Manual, Automatic, Inactive</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Access Sequence</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">A001, A002, dll</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Condition Record ID</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor referensi ID master harga yang dipakai</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Validity</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Valid From / Valid To</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Origin</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Customer / Group / Base</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </li>
</ul>

<h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1">Field Name</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Example / Keterangan</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Condition Type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ZS01 (Base Price), ZS02 (Discount)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Access Sequence</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">A001 (Customer+Material -> Material)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Requirement Routine</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Optional (Custom Code Block)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Condition Exclusion Group</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Group A (Menentukan kondisi mana yang saling eksklusif)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Scale Basis</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Quantity / Value / Weight</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Calculation Type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Amount / Percent / Quantity</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Manual Entry</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Yes/No (Unlock UI input)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Mandatory</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Yes/No (Must exist to save SO)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Statistical</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Yes/No (Excludes from Net Value & AR)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Account Key</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ERL (Revenue), ERS (Discount), MWS (Tax)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Currency & Price Unit</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">IDR / 1 PCS, USD / 100 KG</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">From Step / To Step</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Base calculation range (e.g. 10 to 90)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1">Behaviour</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Default Configuration</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Pricing Date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Document Date (Tanggal SO/Quotation)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Exchange Rate Date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Document Date (Menghindari selisih kurs)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cost Determination Date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Document Date (Menarik HPP pada hari itu)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Currency</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Mengikuti mata uang Customer Master Data</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Pricing Type on Copy</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Copy unchanged (Lihat tabel 8.1)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Margin Warning Threshold</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">5%</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Manual Override</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Diizinkan jika konfig master flag <code>Manual = Yes</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tax Calculation</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Dieksekusi mutlak setelah <em>Net Value</em> (DPP) didapat</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>8.1 Copy Pricing Behaviour</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1">Skenario Transisi Dokumen</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Behaviour <em>Pricing Engine</em></th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Quotation → Sales Order</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Copy unchanged (Harga mutlak sama)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sales Order → Delivery</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Copy unchanged</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sales Order → Invoice</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Re-determine tax only (Pajak dihitung ulang jika aturan pajak berubah)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Manual Repricing (Update Button)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Recalculate all active conditions (Menarik master harga terbaru)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>9. Functional Rules (Core Algorithm)</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm">
    <li><strong>FR-01 Access Sequence Priority:</strong> Engine membaca rekaman spesifik (Customer+Material), jika gagal baru turun ke *general* (Material).</li>
    <li><strong>FR-02 Subtotal Cascade:</strong> Pajak (ZS18) menghitung % berdasarkan akumulasi dari *From Step* s/d *To Step* baris DPP.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-03 Cost Margin (VPRS):</strong> Menarik `VPRS` (HPP barang). Flag `VPRS` mutlak <strong>Statistical = Yes</strong> agar tidak menambah tagihan. Margin = (Net Value - VPRS).</li>
    <li><strong>FR-04 Freight Handling:</strong> <code>KF00</code> (Billable) diakumulasikan ke DPP. <code>KF01</code> (Statistical) diturunkan ke tabel transaksi namun diabaikan saat penjumlahan Total AR.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-05 Currency Transmogrification:</strong> Jika Harga Jual di-maintain EUR namun Dokumen IDR, otomatis <em>fetch</em> Exchange Rate.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-06 Condition Exclusion:</strong> Jika dua *Condition Type* berada dalam *Condition Exclusion Group* yang sama, maka *Engine* hanya mengaktifkan kondisi dengan prioritas tertinggi atau nilai yang paling menguntungkan pelanggan sesuai konfigurasi *Exclusion Rule* (salah satu di-set *Inactive*).</li>
    <li><strong>FR-09 Free Goods Valuation:</strong> Jika kondisi <code>FREE</code> dipicu, mesin secara otomatis menimpa (override) <em>Base Price</em> menjadi nilai HPP/COGS (VPRS) barang tersebut, agar nilai tagihan dan pembebanan internal/eksternal persis sama dengan <em>Inventory Out</em> tanpa memunculkan margin semu.</li>
</ul>

