<h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm">
    <li><strong>VR-01 Expired Record:</strong> Harga master dengan `Valid To` &lt; `Pricing Date` diharamkan masuk ke kalkulasi.</li>
    <li><strong>VR-02 Mandatory Block:</strong> Jika komponen wajib (ZS01) hilang, sistem memblokir *Save*.</li>
    <li><strong>VR-03 Duplication Defense:</strong> Tidak boleh ada dua kondisi harga dasar yang *Active* bersamaan.</li>
    <li><strong>VR-04 Valid Currency:</strong> Kurs silang harus tersedia di *Exchange Rate Master*.</li>
    <li><strong>VR-05 Price Unit Validation:</strong> Jika <code>Price Unit ≠ 1</code>, maka sistem <strong>wajib melakukan konversi harga ke Base UoM</strong> sebelum kalkulasi subtotal. (Sangat rawan bug pada kalkulasi volume).</li>
</ul>

<h2>11. Workflow (State Transition)</h2>
<pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono leading-relaxed" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
Draft (Item Entered)
↓
Pricing Engine Executed (Automatic Subtotaling)
↓
Margin Checked (VPRS vs Net Value)
↓
Margin &lt; Threshold?
├─ Yes → Approval Wait
└─ No  → Continue
↓
Manual Override (User adjusting Discount)
↓
Sales Order Released
</pre>

