<h2>13. Notification</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm">
    <li><strong>Expired Price Agreement:</strong> Alert ke Sales saat Harga Master telah kedaluwarsa.</li>
    <li><strong>Low Margin Alert:</strong> Notifikasi ke Sales Manager jika Profit Margin &lt; 5%.</li>
    <li><strong>Price Changed During Repricing:</strong> Jika user menekan *Update Pricing* dan harga referensi telah berubah, tampilkan alert: <em>"Harga item A berubah dari Rp100.000 menjadi Rp105.000 berdasarkan master harga terbaru."</em></li>
</ul>

<h2>14. API / Interface (Engine Endpoint)</h2>
<div class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono leading-relaxed" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
POST /api/sales-pricing/calculate

[Input Payload]
- pricing_mode: "simulation | document | copy"
- pricing_date
- document_currency
- customer_id
- sales_area (sales_org, distribution_channel)
- lines (material_id, quantity, uom, price_unit)

[Output Payload]
- status
- lines (net_price, tax_amount, cost_vprs, profit_margin, conditions array)

[Purpose]
Dipanggil seketika saat simulasi, pembuatan order baru, maupun repricing. Field `pricing_mode` menentukan tingkat persistensi Engine terhadap Database.
</div>

