<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li>ERR-SPR-001: Sales Pricing Procedure Not Found.</li>
    <li>ERR-SPR-002: Base Price (ZS01) is mandatory but missing.</li>
    <li>ERR-SPR-003: Cannot calculate Output Tax due to missing Tax Code.</li>
    <li>ERR-SPR-004: Exchange rate not maintained.</li>
    <li>ERR-SPR-005: Manual override rejected.</li>
    <li><strong class="text-red-500">ERR-SPR-006: Condition exclusion conflict detected.</strong></li>
    <li><strong class="text-red-500">ERR-SPR-007: Price unit conversion failed.</strong></li>
</ul>

