    <li><strong>Transaction Overrides:</strong> Merekam aksi override diskon di UI.</li>
    <li><strong>Repricing Event:</strong> Mencatat <em>old net value</em> vs <em>new net value</em> beserta <em>trigger</em> pemicunya (qty change / pricing date change / manual update).</li>
</ul>

