<h2>19. Test Scenario (20 Mandatory QA Scenarios)</h2>
<ol class="list-decimal pl-5 mb-4 text-sm">
    <li>Customer Specific Price override Base Price (Access Sequence check)</li>
    <li>Sales Group Discount Percentage calculation</li>
    <li>Manual Absolute Discount insertion</li>
    <li>Multiple Cascading Discounts</li>
    <li>Currency Translation (Customer USD, Base Price IDR)</li>
    <li>VPRS Cost retrieval (Margin = Net Value - Cost)</li>
    <li>VPRS Statistical Check (Does NOT add to Net Value)</li>
    
    
    <li>Output Tax (ZS18) evaluated correctly on top of DPP</li>
    <li>Expired Customer Price falls back to Base Price</li>
    <li>Mandatory Price (ZS01) missing throws ERR-SPR-002</li>
    <li>No Exchange Rate mapped throws ERR-SPR-004</li>
    <li>Rounding behavior aligns with Master Currency</li>
<li>Inactive Condition check (Skipped from subtotal)</li>
    <li>Manual Override rejected on non-manual condition types</li>
    <li class="font-bold text-blue-800">Customer price exists but currency mismatch (Engine must cross-exchange rate)</li>
    <li class="font-bold text-blue-800">Two valid customer prices overlap (Condition Exclusion logic triggers)</li>
    
    <li class="font-bold text-blue-800">Margin becomes negative after manual discount (Approval workflow triggered)</li>
</ol>

