</table>

<h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Spesifikasi ini mengatur arsitektur logis untuk pencatatan Sales Order, integrasi validasi limit kredit reaktif (Credit Control Middleware), snapshot data master, dan pemetaan ke 16-Step Sales Pricing Engine.</p>

<h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li>Order-to-Cash (O2C)</li>
    <li>Credit Risk Management</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Use Case</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Create Sales Order (Header, Items, Schedule Lines)</li>
    <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Evaluate Credit Risk & Auto-Block</li>
    <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Release Credit Blocked Order</li>
    <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Process Item Rejection</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
<pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono leading-relaxed" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
Sales Form -> Submit -> evaluateCreditRisk()
   ↓
[Plafon Terlampaui?]
  ├── Yes -> Simpan status CREDIT_BLOCKED
  └── No  -> Simpan status APPROVED
</pre>

<h2>6. Screen Specification (UI)</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Formulir pendaftaran SO multi-tab: Header Data (Pilih Customer, Term of Payment, Currency), Item Grid (Material, Qty, SLoc, Unit Price), dan Schedule Lines (Tanggal Janji Kirim). Tab log audit mencatat sejarah release/block.</p>

