            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deleted_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Penanda waktu penghapusan logis (Soft Delete, data transaksi tidak boleh dihapus secara fisik).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deleted_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID user yang melakukan soft-delete dokumen.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>16.2 Centralized Change Log (Tabel: <code>audit_logs</code>)</h3>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Setiap aksi modifikasi data (Create, Update, Delete) akan direkam ke dalam tabel log audit terpusat dengan skema berikut:</p>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Keterangan</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Primary key log audit.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">user_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">User pelaku perubahan data.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">event</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Aktivitas tindakan: <code>CREATED</code>, <code>UPDATED</code>, <code>DELETED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">auditable_type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(100)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nama model / tabel yang berubah (misal: <code>App\\Models\\SalesOrder</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">auditable_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID record data yang diubah.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">old_values</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">JSON</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Snapshot nilai kolom sebelum diubah (Hanya terisi pada event UPDATED & DELETED).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">new_values</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">JSON</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Snapshot nilai kolom sesudah diubah (Hanya terisi pada event CREATED & UPDATED).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">ip_address</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(45)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Alamat IP perangkat pembuat transaksi.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu kejadian log audit.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

<h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Mengaitkan data master ke tabel transaksi: <code>sales_orders</code>, <code>sales_order_lines</code>, <code>sales_order_conditions</code>, <code>sales_order_schedule_lines</code>, dan <code>activity_logs</code>.</p>

<h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Sales UI -> API Gateway -> evaluateCreditRisk() -> Simpan Header/Lines -> Log Activity.</p>

<h2>19. Test Scenario</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
