                    'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk AR Invoice. Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-070.',
                    'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-13</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Shipment Plan</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-45</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Logistics / Shipment Planning</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul Shipment Architecture mengelola siklus rencana pengiriman barang (Shipment Plan) dari penggabungan muatan beberapa baris Sales Order ke satu armada kendaraan, validasi kapasitas berat/volume, penentuan urutan rute multi-drop, hingga pembaruan status perjalanan dan pemicu modul Shipment Cost saat pengiriman selesai.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Order-to-Cash (O2C): Sales Order &rarr; Shipment Plan &rarr; Barang Jalan &rarr; Shipment Cost &rarr; AR Invoice.</li>
        <li>Logistics Outbound Execution.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> User Logistik membuat Shipment Plan baru dan memilih kendaraan armada tersedia.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> User menambahkan baris muatan dari SO yang belum terkirim ke dalam Shipment Plan.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Sistem memvalidasi total berat muatan tidak melebihi kapasitas kendaraan.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> User merilis Shipment Plan ke status <code>PLANNED</code> dan mencetak Surat Jalan.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-05:</strong> User mengkonfirmasi keberangkatan armada ke status <code>IN_TRANSIT</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-06:</strong> User mengkonfirmasi seluruh titik bongkar selesai dan mengubah status ke <code>DELIVERED</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-07:</strong> Supervisor menutup Shipment ke status <code>COMPLETED</code>, memicu pembuatan Shipment Cost otomatis.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Pembuatan Shipment Plan (DRAFT) &rarr; Pilih Kendaraan &rarr; Tambah Baris SO (Muatan) &rarr; Validasi Kapasitas &rarr; Rilis Rencana Jalan (PLANNED) &rarr; Cetak Surat Jalan &rarr; Armada Berangkat (IN_TRANSIT) &rarr; Konfirmasi Bongkar (DELIVERED) &rarr; Closing Logistik (COMPLETED) &rarr; Trigger Shipment Cost.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar multitab Fiori-style dengan:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Tab Header:</strong> Data kendaraan armada, transporter, sopir, rute, RDD, incoterm, total berat/volume muatan, status.</li>
        <li><strong>Tab Lines:</strong> Tabel baris muatan SO, stop sequence, berat, volume per baris.</li>
        <li><strong>Tab Audit:</strong> Log perubahan status dan riwayat tindakan pengguna.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Spesifikasi field lengkap untuk modul Shipment Plan. Terbagi atas Header Armada, Detail Baris Muatan, dan Referensi Master Kendaraan.</p>

    <h3>7.1 Shipment Header Table (<code>shipment_headers</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">shipment_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor Shipment Plan unik hasil auto-generate dari rentang <code>8120000000 - 8129999999</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">company_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; companies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Entitas perusahaan induk pemilik transaksi ekspedisi (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang/Gudang pembuat dan penanggung jawab rencana pengiriman (Wajib terisi, isolasi data regional).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">shipment_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal pembuatan dokumen rencana ekspedisi (Wajib terisi, default tanggal hari ini).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">requested_delivery_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal rencana keberangkatan armada / Requested Delivery Date (RDD, Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">incoterm_code</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(10)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Syarat penyerahan barang: <code>FCO</code> (Franco / diantar) atau <code>LCO</code> (Loco / diambil).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">transporter_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; vendors, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Vendor/Ekspedisi pengangkut barang (Nullable jika menggunakan armada sendiri / Own Fleet).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">vehicle_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; vehicles)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Kendaraan armada pengangkut penentu kapasitas berat dan volume muatan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">driver_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; employees, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Sopir pengemudi armada (Nullable jika transporter eksternal mengelola sopir sendiri).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">route_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; routes, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Rute perjalanan logistik yang telah dikonfigurasi di master rute.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_weight</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jumlah berat kotor total muatan aktual (Kalkulasi otomatis dari <code>SUM(shipment_lines.weight)</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_volume</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jumlah volume total muatan aktual (Kalkulasi otomatis dari <code>SUM(shipment_lines.volume)</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">notes</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TEXT (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Catatan instruksi logistik tambahan untuk sopir atau transporter.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status perjalanan armada: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>PLANNED</code>, <code>IN_TRANSIT</code>, <code>DELIVERED</code>, <code>COMPLETED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">cost_status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status realisasi ongkos angkut: <code>PENDING</code>, <code>REALIZED</code>. Diisi otomatis oleh modul Shipment Cost.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu pembuatan record (Otomatis terisi saat INSERT).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pembuat dokumen (Otomatis dari session login).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">updated_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu modifikasi terakhir (Otomatis terisi saat UPDATE).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">updated_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pengubah terakhir.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deleted_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Penanda soft delete — data transaksi tidak boleh dihapus secara fisik.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deleted_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pelaku soft delete.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.2 Detail Lines Table (<code>shipment_lines</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key detail baris.</td></tr>
