            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_volume</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jumlah volume total muatan aktual (Kalkulasi otomatis dari <code>SUM(shipment_lines.volume)</code>).</td></tr>
