            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">shipment_header_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; shipment_headers)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Menghubungkan baris detail dengan header induk Shipment (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang/Gudang asal fisik muatan untuk baris detail ini (Wajib terisi di level item).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">sales_order_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; sales_orders, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Referensi induk Sales Order asal muatan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">sales_order_line_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; sales_order_lines)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tautan ke baris detail SO asal — sumber data kuantitas pengiriman (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">customer_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; customers)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Pelanggan tujuan pengiriman pada baris ini (diambil otomatis dari SO).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">ship_to_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; customers)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Alamat tujuan pengiriman fisik (Ship-to Partner dari SO).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">item_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; items)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Barang yang dikirimkan (diambil otomatis dari baris SO).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">quantity</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas muatan untuk baris ini (Wajib &gt; 0, tidak boleh melebihi sisa open qty SO).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">uom_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; uoms)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Satuan ukuran muatan barang (diambil dari UOM SO).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">weight</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Berat kotor baris ini: <code>quantity × item.gross_weight</code> (Kalkulasi otomatis).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">volume</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Volume baris ini: <code>quantity × item.unit_volume</code> (Kalkulasi otomatis).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">stop_sequence</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">INT</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Urutan titik bongkar/drop-off muatan pada rute multi-drop (Wajib &gt; 0, urut ascending).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.3 Vehicles Reference Table (<code>vehicles</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Primary key master kendaraan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">plate_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor plat kendaraan unik (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jenis kendaraan (misal: Truk Engkel, Truk Fuso, Pickup).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">ownership</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kepemilikan armada: <code>OWN</code> (Armada sendiri) atau <code>EXTERNAL</code> (Armada transporter).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">max_weight</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kapasitas berat muatan maksimal kendaraan dalam satuan Kg (Wajib &gt; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">max_volume</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kapasitas volume muatan maksimal kendaraan dalam satuan M&sup3; (Wajib &gt; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status ketersediaan armada: <code>AVAILABLE</code>, <code>IN_USE</code>, <code>MAINTENANCE</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang/Pool pemilik armada kendaraan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">is_active</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BOOLEAN</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status keaktifan kendaraan dalam sistem (Default: true).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Default status dokumen baru adalah <code>DRAFT</code>.</li>
        <li>Dropdown kendaraan hanya memunculkan armada dengan status <code>AVAILABLE</code> pada tanggal RDD yang dipilih.</li>
        <li>Field <code>total_weight</code> dan <code>total_volume</code> dihitung otomatis setiap ada penambahan/penghapusan baris muatan.</li>
        <li>Field <code>customer_id</code>, <code>ship_to_id</code>, <code>item_id</code> pada baris muatan diisi otomatis dari data SO yang dipilih.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
    <h3>9.1 Document Flow &amp; Status Matrix</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Awal</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Aksi / Pemicu Transisi</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Akhir</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aturan Bisnis</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DRAFT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Rilis Rencana Jalan</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>PLANNED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Validasi kapasitas lulus. Status kendaraan &rarr; IN_USE. Surat Jalan dapat dicetak.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>PLANNED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Konfirmasi Gate Out / Berangkat</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>IN_TRANSIT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Armada dinyatakan sedang dalam perjalanan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>IN_TRANSIT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Konfirmasi Selesai Bongkar Semua Titik</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DELIVERED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Armada kembali, siap verifikasi logistik.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DELIVERED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Closing &amp; Verifikasi oleh Supervisor</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>COMPLETED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status kendaraan &rarr; AVAILABLE. Trigger otomatis pembuatan Shipment Cost.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-01 (Weight Cap):</strong> <code>SUM(shipment_lines.weight) &le; vehicles.max_weight</code> — sistem menolak penambahan baris jika validasi gagal.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-02 (Volume Cap):</strong> <code>SUM(shipment_lines.volume) &le; vehicles.max_volume</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-03 (Open Qty):</strong> Kuantitas muatan baris tidak boleh melebihi sisa open qty dari baris SO terkait.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-04 (Branch Match):</strong> Branch ID baris SO wajib identik dengan Branch ID header Shipment.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-05 (Vehicle Availability):</strong> Kendaraan wajib berstatus <code>AVAILABLE</code> pada tanggal RDD saat dipilih.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
    <p>Pembuatan Shipment Plan tidak memerlukan persetujuan bertingkat secara default. Deviasi tonase &gt; 10% di atas kapasitas kendaraan memerlukan otorisasi dari <code>LOGISTICS_SUPERVISOR</code>.</p>

    <h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Role</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Create</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Edit</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Release (PLANNED)</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Complete</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>LOGISTICS_PLANNER</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓ (DRAFT only)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">-</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>LOGISTICS_SUPERVISOR</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>ADMIN</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">✓</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>13. Notification</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Notifikasi WhatsApp/Email kepada sopir berisi rincian rute multi-drop dikirim otomatis saat status berubah ke <code>PLANNED</code>.</li>
        <li>Notifikasi kepada Supervisor Logistik jika validasi kapasitas melampaui batas toleransi.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>POST /api/shipments</code> — Membuat Shipment Plan baru.</li>
        <li><code>PUT /api/shipments/{id}/lines</code> — Menambahkan/memperbarui baris muatan.</li>
        <li><code>PATCH /api/shipments/{id}/status</code> — Mengubah status perjalanan.</li>
        <li><code>GET /api/shipments/{id}/capacity</code> — Mengambil sisa kapasitas berat/volume armada secara real-time.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>ERR-SHIP-001</code>: Kapasitas kendaraan terlampaui — penambahan baris ditolak.</li>
        <li><code>ERR-SHIP-002</code>: Kendaraan berstatus <code>MAINTENANCE</code> atau <code>IN_USE</code> — pemilihan armada ditolak.</li>
        <li><code>ERR-SHIP-003</code>: Baris SO dari cabang berbeda — konsolidasi ditolak.</li>
        <li><code>ERR-SHIP-004</code>: Kuantitas melebihi open qty SO — input baris ditolak.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
    <p>Setiap pergantian status dan perubahan data terekam otomatis pada tabel <code>audit_logs</code> dengan kolom standar: <code>created_at</code>, <code>created_by</code>, <code>updated_at</code>, <code>updated_by</code>, <code>deleted_at</code> (soft delete), <code>deleted_by</code>.</p>

    <h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
    <p>Relasi utama pada ERD 00: <code>shipment_headers</code> (1) &rarr; (N) <code>shipment_lines</code> &rarr; (N) <code>sales_order_lines</code>. <code>shipment_headers</code> &rarr; <code>vehicles</code>, <code>vendors</code> (transporter), <code>branches</code>.</p>

    <h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
    <p>Logistics Planner &rarr; Buat Shipment Plan &rarr; Sistem Validasi Kapasitas &rarr; Rilis ke PLANNED &rarr; Sistem Update Status Kendaraan IN_USE &rarr; Cetak Surat Jalan &rarr; Armada Berangkat (IN_TRANSIT) &rarr; Konfirmasi Bongkar (DELIVERED) &rarr; Closing oleh Supervisor (COMPLETED) &rarr; Sistem Trigger Shipment Cost.</p>

    <h2>19. Test Scenario</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>TC-01:</strong> Tambah baris muatan dengan berat total melampaui kapasitas kendaraan &rarr; Hasil: Sistem menolak dan menampilkan error <code>ERR-SHIP-001</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>TC-02:</strong> Pilih kendaraan dengan status <code>MAINTENANCE</code> &rarr; Hasil: Kendaraan tidak muncul dalam dropdown pilihan.</li>
        <li><strong>TC-03:</strong> Rilis Shipment ke <code>PLANNED</code> &rarr; Hasil: Status kendaraan berubah menjadi <code>IN_USE</code> secara otomatis.</li>
        <li><strong>TC-04:</strong> Closing Shipment ke <code>COMPLETED</code> &rarr; Hasil: Dokumen Shipment Cost terbentuk otomatis di modul Shipment Cost.</li>
        <li><strong>TC-05:</strong> Input baris SO dari cabang berbeda &rarr; Hasil: Sistem menolak dengan error <code>ERR-SHIP-003</code>.</li>
    </ul>

        <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-01 (Chronological Posting Date):</strong> Tanggal posting pengeluaran barang (Goods Issue / PGI) wajib memenuhi aturan urutan kronologis: <code>shipments.posting_date &ge; sales_orders.document_date</code> dan <code>shipments.posting_date &le; CURRENT_DATE</code> (tidak boleh di masa depan).</li>
    </ul>

<h2>20. Future Enhancement</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Integrasi GPS real-time untuk pelacakan koordinat armada saat status <code>IN_TRANSIT</code>.</li>
        <li>Integrasi API peta digital untuk estimasi waktu kedatangan (ETA) per titik bongkar.</li>
        <li>Dukungan multi-kendaraan dalam satu Shipment Plan (konvoi).</li>
    </ul>
