                'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Customer Return (Retur Penjualan). Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-061.',
                    'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-14</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - AR Invoice &amp; Pricing Copy Control</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-13</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sales &amp; Distribution / Accounts Receivable</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">3.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul AR Invoice mengelola siklus pembuatan tagihan kepada customer berdasarkan realisasi pengiriman barang fisik (Delivery Order / DO) atau penagihan jasa secara manual, memastikan keakuratan nilai tagihan melalui Pricing Copy Control langsung dari order asal.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Order-to-Cash (O2C): Customer Billing / Invoicing.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Billing Clerk membuat draf AR Invoice baru dengan merujuk nomor DO.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Sistem otomatis menyalin kuantitas dari DO dan harga dari SO (Pricing Copy Control).</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Clerk meninjau kalkulasi PPN Keluaran dan nominal kotor/bersih tagihan.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Clerk memposting AR Invoice (POSTED) yang memicu pencatatan piutang dagang dan PPN di Buku Besar.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Rujuk DO &rarr; Ambil Data DO &amp; SO &rarr; Pricing Copy Control &rarr; Kalkulasi PPN Keluaran &rarr; Posting AR Invoice &rarr; Update Outstanding Piutang &rarr; Selesai.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar Fiori-style:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Header:</strong> Nomor Invoice, Customer, Document Date, Posting Date, Entry Date (ReadOnly), Total Gross, PPN Keluaran, Total Net, Status.</li>
        <li><strong>Detail Table:</strong> Pilihan Item, Kuantitas, UOM, Harga Satuan (Locked), Diskon, Tarif Pajak, Nominal Pajak, Nilai Bersih Baris.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <h3>7.1 Customer Invoice Header Table (<code>customer_invoices</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">invoice_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor dokumen AR Invoice unik (Range: <code>9100000000 - 9199999999</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">company_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; companies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID perusahaan induk (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Cabang pencatat piutang (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">customer_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; customers)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Pelanggan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">document_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal fisik penerbitan dokumen tagihan (dapat backdated).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">posting_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal efektif pencatatan akuntansi ke Buku Besar (tidak boleh melebihi tanggal berjalan).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">entry_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu aktual data disimpan otomatis di database.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_gross_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total nilai tagihan kotor sebelum pajak.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_tax_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total nilai PPN Keluaran hasil kalkulasi pajak.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_net_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total nilai bersih tagihan akhir: <code>gross + tax</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">outstanding_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sisa saldo piutang yang belum terbayar (dikurangi saat payment).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status tagihan: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>UNPAID</code>, <code>PARTIALLY_PAID</code>, <code>PAID</code>, <code>CANCELLED</code>.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.2 Customer Invoice Lines Table (<code>customer_invoice_lines</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">customer_invoice_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; customer_invoices)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Menghubungkan baris detail dengan header tagihan (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang pencatat transaksi penjualan fisik untuk item terkait.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">delivery_order_line_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; shipment_lines)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tautan ke baris detail DO pengiriman asal (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">item_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; items)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Referensi barang terdaftar yang ditagih.</td></tr>
