                    'content' => '<h2>1. Document Information</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
    <tbody>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-16</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Cost Center Management</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-47</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Finance / Controlling</td></tr>
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Spesifikasi ini mengatur fungsionalitas manajemen Pusat Biaya (Cost Center) untuk melacak pengeluaran operasional per departemen. Modul ini terintegrasi dengan mesin jurnal untuk memastikan keharusan input Pusat Biaya pada akun beban operasional (OPEX).</p>

<h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm">
    <li>Cost Center Master Data Creation</li>
    <li>Hierarchical Cost Tracking</li>
    <li>Expense Journal Posting Integration</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Use Case</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Create & Update Cost Center</li>
    <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> View Cost Center Hierarchy</li>
    <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Enforce Cost Center Validation on Journal Entry</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
<pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono leading-relaxed" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
[Siklus Jurnal & Validasi Pusat Biaya]
Jurnal Transaksi -> Cek Akun -> require_cost_center = TRUE?
                                     ↓
          [Ya] → Cek input Cost Center pada baris jurnal
                                     ↓
          Terisi & Valid? → Simpan Jurnal
          [Tidak] → Batalkan Posting (Error: Cost Center Required)
</pre>

<h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
<p class="mb-2 text-sm">Modul menggunakan antarmuka administrasi standard:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Tree-Grid View:</strong> Menampilkan daftar seluruh Pusat Biaya berdasarkan struktur hierarki induk-anak.</li>
    <li><strong>Form Input:</strong>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Code:</strong> Text input unik.</li>
            <li><strong>Name:</strong> Nama deskriptif Pusat Biaya.</li>
            <li><strong>Parent Cost Center:</strong> Dropdown pencarian pusat biaya berjenis kelompok/induk.</li>
            <li><strong>Associated Branch:</strong> Dropdown pilihan cabang aktif.</li>
            <li><strong>Category:</strong> Dropdown pilihan (Administrasi, Produksi, Pemasaran, Logistik).</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Spesifikasi field lengkap untuk tabel master data pusat biaya (Cost Center):</p>
    
    <h3>7.1 Cost Center Table (<code>cost_centers</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type & Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation & Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">company_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; companies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Menghubungkan pusat biaya dengan badan hukum induk perusahaan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">code</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kode pusat biaya unik dan alfanumerik (Wajib terisi, misal: CC-MKT-01).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">name</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(255)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nama operasional pusat biaya (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">parent_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; cost_centers, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID rujukan pusat biaya induk jika diatur secara berjenjang/hierarki (Opsional).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang penanggung jawab/pemilik operasional pusat biaya (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">responsible_person</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(100) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nama penanggung jawab pusat biaya (Manager/PIC).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">description</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TEXT (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Catatan penjelasan/deskripsi detail alokasi penggunaan pusat biaya.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status keaktifan pusat biaya. Pilihan: <code>ACTIVE</code>, <code>BLOCKED</code>, <code>INACTIVE</code> (Default: ACTIVE).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

<h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li>Pusat biaya baru yang dibuat langsung berstatus ACTIVE.</li>
    <li>Branch ID secara default terisi sesuai konteks cabang sesi login pengguna aktif.</li>
</ul>

<h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li><strong>FR-01:</strong> Jurnal umum manual maupun otomatis yang melibatkan akun beban dengan flag require_cost_center wajib menyertakan cost_center_id yang bertatus ACTIVE.</li>
</ul>

<h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li><strong>VAL-01:</strong> Menolak penunjukan parent_id jika membentuk perulangan hierarki (circular dependency).</li>
    <li><strong>VAL-02:</strong> Menonaktifkan penghapusan fisik jika record id sudah tercatat di tabel journal_lines.</li>
</ul>

<h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Penambahan pusat biaya baru disetujui langsung oleh Finance Controller / Accounting Manager setelah divalidasi kodenya.</p>

<h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Staff Accounting memiliki hak membaca dan menginput. Administrator / Accounting Manager memiliki otoritas penuh untuk menambah/mengubah parameter kontrol.</p>

<h2>13. Notification</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Tidak ada notifikasi eksternal khusus, notifikasi perubahan tercatat pada log sistem.</p>

<h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
<p class="mb-2 text-sm">Endpoint `POST /api/finance/cost-centers`</p>
<pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
{
  "code": "CC-ADM-01",
  "name": "General Administration Department",
  "parent_id": null,
  "branch_id": 1,
  "category": "ADM"
}
</pre>

<h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li><strong>ERR-CC-001:</strong> "Cost Center Blocked: The selected cost center is currently blocked from posting."</li>
    <li><strong>ERR-CC-002:</strong> "Missing Cost Center: Selected account requires a valid cost center dimension."</li>
</ul>

<h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Mencatat pembuatan, modifikasi penanggung jawab, perubahan status, dan pemindahan relasi hierarki pusat biaya.</p>

<h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Tabel target database baru adalah <code>cost_centers</code> yang berelasi ke <code>branches</code> dan <code>journal_lines</code>.</p>

<h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level - Posting Validation)</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Journal Invoice -> Hit Journal Lines -> Trigger Validation Filter -> Cek status Cost Center -> Approved -> Save Journal.</p>

<h2>19. Test Scenario</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-sm font-mono">
    <li><strong>TS-01 (Mandatory Check):</strong> Post jurnal tanpa menyertakan Cost Center ke akun beban operasional. [Hasil: Gagal / Terblokir].</li>
    <li><strong>TS-02 (Blocked CC Post):</strong> Post jurnal dengan Cost Center berstatus BLOCKED. [Hasil: Gagal / Terblokir].</li>
</ul>

<h2>20. Future Enhancement</h2>
<p class="mb-4 text-sm">Integrasi modul anggaran (Budgeting) untuk melakukan pengecekan batas plafon pengeluaran biaya per Pusat Biaya secara real-time saat transaksi dimasukkan.</p>',
