    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul Customer Return mengelola siklus penanganan pengembalian barang dari pelanggan, mendukung tipe pengajuan berdokumen rujukan Billing Penjualan (With Reference - Full/Partial) maupun tanpa dokumen rujukan (Without Reference).</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Inbound Gate In Return (GIR)</li>
        <li>Credit Memo Posting & AR Alignment</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Create Return Order (Request) - Tipe With Ref (mengacu ke Billing Penjualan) / Without Ref.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Process WMS Inbound GIR (Physical Receipt).</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Process Logistics Return Approval (BLC & RLM).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
Sales Request (With/Without Ref) &rarr; Validate Billing Qty Limits &rarr; Create Return Document &rarr; WMS Gate In Receipt &rarr; Approval (BLC & RLM) &rarr; Generate Credit Memo
    </pre>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Form pembuatan Return Order memuat radio button pilihan Tipe Referensi (With Reference / Without Reference). Jika memilih \'With Reference\', input Faktur Penjualan (Billing) wajib diisi dan item grid dimuat otomatis dengan opsi edit kuantitas (Partial/Full).</p>

