                    'title' => 'Stock Adjustment (Opname)',
                    'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Stock Adjustment (Opname). Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-055.',
                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-18</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Document Numbering & Transaction Type Engine</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-48</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Core Shared Configuration</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul ini mendefinisikan arsitektur fungsional mesin penomoran otomatis dokumen (Number Range Engine) dan konfigurasi pemetaan alur dokumen (Copy Control Mapping) lintas modul transaksi.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Global Transaction Document Numbering Configuration</li>
        <li>Document Flow Copy Control Management</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Configure Document Number Range.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Create Document Type and Map Number Range.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Set Document Flow Mappings (Copy Control).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
Request Posting &rarr; Cari Tipe Dokumen &rarr; Dapatkan Relasi Number Range &rarr; Lock Baris DB &rarr; Increment Counter &rarr; Kembalikan Format Nomor &rarr; Save Transaksi
    </pre>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Halaman admin terbagi atas dua tab utama: Tab Pertama untuk mendefinisikan awalan/akhiran/panjang digit penomoran (Number Ranges) dengan dukungan nilai numerik murni, dan Tab Kedua untuk mengelola matriks pemetaan alur tipe dokumen asal dan tipe dokumen tujuan (Copy Control Mappings).</p>

        <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Spesifikasi field lengkap terbagi atas tabel Konfigurasi Nomor (Number Ranges), Tipe Dokumen, dan Pemetaan Alur Transaksi (Copy Control):</p>
    
    <h3>7.1 Document Number Ranges (<code>document_number_ranges</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type & Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation & Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">code</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kode identifikasi rentang (misal: <code>NUM_SO_STD</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">name</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(100)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nama deskriptif rentang penomoran.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">prefix</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(10) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Awalan karakter (Dikosongkan untuk format numerik murni).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">suffix</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(10) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Akhiran karakter (Dikosongkan untuk format numerik murni).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">start_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Batas awal angka urut (misal: 7000000000).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">end_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Batas akhir angka urut (misal: 7099999999).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">length</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">INT</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Panjang digit padding untuk angka urut (misal: 8 atau 10 digit).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">current_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Angka urut berjalan saat ini (Meningkat seiring pembuatan transaksi baru).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">reset_policy</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kebijakan reset counter: <code>CONTINUOUS</code> atau <code>RESET_YEARLY</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">is_active</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BOOLEAN</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Indikator keaktifan pola penomoran (Default: true).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.2 Document Types (<code>document_types</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type & Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation & Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">category</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Modul/Kelompok tipe dokumen (misal: <code>SALES_ORDER</code>, <code>JOURNAL</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">code</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kode identifikasi tipe dokumen (misal: <code>SO_STD</code>, <code>JV_STD</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">name</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(100)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nama deskriptif tipe dokumen.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">number_range_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; document_number_ranges)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Menghubungkan tipe dokumen dengan pola penomoran yang diaktifkan (Wajib diisi).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.3 Document Type Mappings (<code>document_type_mappings</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type & Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation & Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">sales_order_type_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; document_types, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Referensi tipe SO asal (misal: SO_STD).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">delivery_type_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; document_types, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Referensi tipe Delivery/GR asal (misal: DO_STD).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">invoice_type_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; document_types, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Referensi tipe Billing/Invoice tujuan (misal: INV_STD).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

<h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
    <p>Secara default, jika prefix dan suffix bernilai kosong/null, sistem menghasilkan penomoran bertipe numerik murni dengan memformat current_number sesuai dengan length yang dikonfigurasi.</p>

    <h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>FR-01:</strong> Transaksi penambahan counter wajib menggunakan database transaksi terisolasi (DB Transaction) dengan perintah locking pesimistik untuk mencegah nomor ganda (race condition).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-01:</strong> Panjang karakter prefix + counter + suffix dilarang melebihi kapasitas kolom nomor dokumen transaksi (maksimal 30 karakter).</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-02:</strong> Tipe dokumen tujuan wajib tervalidasi kompatibilitas modulnya terhadap tipe dokumen asal (misal: tipe SO hanya boleh dipetakan ke tipe DO/Invoice).</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-03:</strong> Angka urut berjalan (current_number) dilarang melebihi nilai batas akhir dari rentang yang ditentukan (misalnya: maksimal 7099999999 untuk SO).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
    <p>Modifikasi penomoran dokumen dan pemetaan alur hanya diizinkan secara langsung oleh System Administrator tanpa approval berjenjang.</p>

    <h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
    <p>Finance/Sales Staff berhak melihat daftar konfigurasi, sedangkan System Administrator memiliki hak penuh untuk Create, Edit, dan Reset Counter.</p>

    <h2>13. Notification</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Sistem memunculkan peringatan sistem (System Alert) ke dashboard admin jika sisa kuota penomoran dokumen di bawah 10% dari kapasitas panjang digit.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
    <p>Endpoint internal: <code>POST /api/core/document-number-ranges/generate</code> yang menerima parameter <code>document_type_code</code> untuk mengembalikan nomor terformat.</p>

    <h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>ERR-NUM-001:</strong> "Number Range Depleted: Penomoran dokumen melampaui kapasitas maksimum digit."</li>
        <li><strong>ERR-NUM-002:</strong> "Inactive Number Range: Pola penomoran tipe dokumen sedang dinonaktifkan."</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
    <p>Pencatatan riwayat perubahan format awalan/akhiran, serta log kejadian reset manual counter penomoran.</p>

    <h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
    <p>Tabel terkait: <code>document_number_ranges</code>, <code>document_types</code>, dan <code>document_type_mappings</code>.</p>

    <h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
    <p>Client -> Post Document -> Generator Service -> Retrieve Format -> Pessimistic Lock -> Update current_number -> Return formatted string -> Save.</p>

    <h2>19. Test Scenario</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>TS-01 (Concurrent Generation):</strong> Simulasi 100 request posting dokumen SO secara bersamaan. [Hasil: Penomoran berurutan tanpa duplikasi].</li>
        <li><strong>TS-02 (Depleted Range Check):</strong> Menyetel length = 10, current_number = 7099999999, lalu memicu transaksi baru untuk SO. [Hasil: Gagal / Error ERR-NUM-001].</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>20. Future Enhancement</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Dukungan auto-reset counter tahunan secara terjadwal setiap pergantian tahun fiskal baru untuk tipe dokumen yang disetel Reset Yearly.</li>
    </ul>
</div>',
                        'status' => 'Under Review',
                        'created_at' => '2026-07-18 01:00:58',
                        'updated_at' => '2026-07-18 04:00:49',
