                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-20</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Purchase Order (PO)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-15</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Materials Management / Purchasing</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">2.4</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul Purchase Order (PO) mengelola siklus pembuatan PO. Form manual mendukung tipe Trade Lokal, Import, Non-Trade, dan PO Asset. Pada PO Asset, sistem menyediakan validasi khusus untuk mengikat barang ke akun aktiva tetap dan Cost Center, serta memicu penciptaan nomor aset 8-digit saat barang diterima fisik.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Purchase Order Processing</li>
        <li>Fixed Asset Acquisition via Purchasing</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Create Purchase Order Manual (Trade / Non-Trade / Asset).</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Auto-Generate PO Freight Cost from Shipment Cost.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
[Penyusunan PO Asset]
Pilih Tipe PO \'Asset\' &rarr; Input Akun Aktiva & Cost Center &rarr; Simpan PO &rarr; Goods Receipt &rarr; Generate Nomor Asset 8-Digit (90xxxxxx)
    </pre>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>UI Form Input menyajikan dynamic form. Saat po_type bernilai \'ASSET\', kolom tabel detail menyajikan dropdown pilihan Asset Account dan Cost Center, serta kolom isian perkiraan umur manfaat aset.</p>

        <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Spesifikasi field terbagi atas tabel Header, tabel Detail/Lines, dan tabel Kondisi Harga (PO Conditions):</p>
    
    <h3>7.1 Header Table (<code>purchase_orders</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type & Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation & Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">po_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor PO unik otomatis, berdasarkan range seeder BRD-48 (Trade: 70xx, Non-Trade: 96xx, Freight: 78xx).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">po_type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tipe PO: <code>TRADE_LOCAL</code>, <code>TRADE_IMPORT</code>, <code>NON_TRADE</code>, <code>PO_FRT</code>, <code>PO_AST</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">vendor_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; vendors)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Pihak supplier/pemasok barang/jasa.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Cabang pembuat (Wajib terisi, mendukung segmentasi multi-branch).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">User penginput transaksi (Otomatis dari session user login).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">po_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal pembuatan dokumen (Default: Current Date).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">currency_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; currencies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Mata uang transaksi PO.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">exchange_rate</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai kurs konversi ke mata uang dasar lokal (Default: 1.00 untuk IDR).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">payment_term_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; payment_terms)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Termin pembayaran jatuh tempo tagihan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">tax_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total PPN Masukan terhitung.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">subtotal_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total nilai barang/jasa sebelum penambahan pajak dan kondisi biaya pengiriman.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai total PO: <code>subtotal + tax + conditions</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status dokumen: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>PENDING_APPROVAL</code>, <code>APPROVED</code>, <code>REJECTED</code>, <code>CLOSED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">source_shipment_cost_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; shipment_costs, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tautan ke dokumen shipment cost pemicu otomatis (Wajib terisi jika tipe = <code>PO_FRT</code>).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

