<h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
    <p>Tabel terkait: <code>purchase_orders</code>, <code>purchase_order_lines</code>, dan <code>assets</code>.</p>

    <h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
