                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-21</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Purchase Requisition (PR)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-50</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Materials Management / Purchasing</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul Purchase Requisition (PR) menyediakan antarmuka bagi seluruh karyawan/departemen untuk mengajukan permintaan barang atau jasa secara internal, serta mengontrol alur otorisasi persetujuan anggaran departemen sebelum dieksekusi oleh tim purchasing.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Internal Purchase Requisition Creation</li>
        <li>Departmental Cost Approval Flow</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Create and Submit Purchase Requisition.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Approve/Reject Purchase Requisition.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Convert Requisition Lines to PO or RFQ.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <pre class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-3 text-xs rounded mb-4 overflow-x-auto font-mono" style="color: #e5e7eb; background-color: #1f2937;">
Karyawan Input PR &rarr; Tentukan Jenis (Trade/Non-Trade) &rarr; Pilih Item & Cost Center &rarr; Kirim &rarr; Approval Kepala Dept &rarr; Rilis untuk PO
    </pre>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Halaman pembuatan PR menyajikan kolom isian Header (Departemen pemohon, Tanggal pengajuan, Tipe PR) dan detail Grid (Nama barang, Satuan, Kuantitas, Cost Center, dan Catatan keperluan).</p>

        <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Spesifikasi field terbagi atas tabel Header dan tabel Detail/Lines:</p>
    
    <h3>7.1 Header Table (<code>purchase_requisitions</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type & Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation & Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">pr_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor PR otomatis, mengambil dari range seeder `NUM_PR` (1000000000 - 1099999999).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">pr_type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tipe permintaan: <code>TRADE</code> atau <code>NON_TRADE</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">department_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; departments)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Identitas departemen internal yang mengajukan PR.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Otorisasi cabang asal transaksi (Wajib terisi, mendukung multi-branch isolation).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">requested_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Karyawan yang menginput PR (otomatis dari data session user login).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">requisition_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal pembuatan dokumen (Default: Current Date).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">required_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal barang/jasa harus tiba (Wajib diisi, harus &ge; requisition_date).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status dokumen: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>PENDING_APPROVAL</code>, <code>APPROVED</code>, <code>REJECTED</code>, <code>CLOSED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_estimated_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total taksiran biaya. Hasil kalkulasi penjumlahan estimated_total_amount pada baris detail.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">description</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TEXT (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Catatan ringkas/tujuan pengajuan PR.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">approved_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID user kepala departemen yang menyetujui dokumen.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">approved_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu persetujuan dirilis oleh approver.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.2 Detail Lines Table (<code>purchase_requisition_lines</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type & Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation & Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">purchase_requisition_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; purchase_requisitions)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Menghubungkan baris detail dengan header induk (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">item_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; items, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Referensi barang terdaftar (Wajib terisi jika pr_type = <code>TRADE</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang/Gudang penerima barang fisik untuk baris detail ini (Wajib terisi di level item).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">item_name_manual</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(255) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nama/deskripsi barang bebas (Wajib terisi jika item_id kosong pada tipe <code>NON_TRADE</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">requested_qty</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jumlah kuantitas yang diminta (Wajib &gt; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">uom_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; uoms)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Satuan ukuran barang (Wajib diisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">estimated_unit_price</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Estimasi harga satuan barang/jasa untuk perhitungan anggaran (Wajib &ge; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">estimated_total_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Hasil kalkulasi: <code>requested_qty * estimated_unit_price</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">converted_qty</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas terkumpul yang sudah berhasil dirilis menjadi PO/RFQ (Default: 0.00).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">open_qty</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4) (Stored/Calculated)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas sisa terbuka: <code>requested_qty - converted_qty</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">cost_center_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; cost_centers, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Pusat biaya penanggung beban pengadaan (Wajib terisi jika pr_type = <code>NON_TRADE</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">expense_account_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; coas, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Akun beban G/L akuntansi (Wajib terisi jika pr_type = <code>NON_TRADE</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">line_status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status baris: <code>OPEN</code>, <code>PARTIALLY_CONVERTED</code>, <code>FULLY_CONVERTED</code>, <code>CLOSED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">notes</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TEXT (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Catatan spesifikasi/justifikasi kebutuhan per item barang.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

<h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
    <p>Secara default, sistem mendeteksi unit departemen pengaju berdasarkan session data login staf pengaju.</p>

    <h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
    <h3>9.1 Document Flow & Status Matrix</h3>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Aturan transisi status dokumen dalam alur proses bisnis Purchase Requisition (P2P Flow):</p>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Awal</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Aksi / Dokumen Downstream</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Akhir</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aturan Sistem</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DRAFT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Submit Approval</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>PENDING_APPROVAL</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Dokumen dikunci, tidak bisa diedit kecuali ditolak.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>PENDING_APPROVAL</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Disetujui oleh Kepala Departemen</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>APPROVED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Dokumen siap untuk dirilis menjadi RFQ atau PO.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>PENDING_APPROVAL</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Ditolak oleh Kepala Departemen</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>REJECTED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kunci terbuka kembali untuk revisi data.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>APPROVED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Konversi Sebagian ke PO/RFQ (Converted Qty &lt; Requested Qty)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>PARTIALLY_CONVERTED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sisa open_qty PR tetap dapat dikonversi menjadi PO/RFQ baru.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>APPROVED</code> / <code>PARTIALLY_CONVERTED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Konversi Selesai (Converted Qty = Requested Qty)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>FULLY_CONVERTED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Dokumen PR tertutup otomatis (open_qty = 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Semua Status Aktif</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Batal Manual (Force Close)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>CLOSED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Membatalkan sisa kuantitas PR yang belum dikonversi.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>FR-01:</strong> Kuantitas sisa terbuka dihitung secara dinamis: <code>open_qty = requested_qty - converted_qty</code>. Tombol \'Convert to PO\' dinonaktifkan jika open_qty bernilai nol.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-01:</strong> Sistem menolak posting PR jika total taksiran nilai barang Non-Trade melampaui sisa kuota anggaran biaya departemen terkait.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
    <p>Dokumen PR wajib disetujui oleh Kepala Departemen (Department Head) pemohon sebelum dilepas ke status APPROVED.</p>

    <h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
    <p>Setiap Karyawan dapat membuat draf PR miliknya sendiri. Manajer Departemen berwenang memberikan persetujuan (Approval) khusus untuk draf PR di departemennya.</p>

    <h2>13. Notification</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Kirim email/push notifikasi ke Kepala Departemen jika ada dokumen PR baru berstatus PENDING_APPROVAL.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
    <p>Endpoint: <code>POST /api/purchasing/purchase-requisitions</code> untuk pendaftaran pengajuan PR.</p>

    <h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>ERR-PR-001:</strong> "Budget Exceeded: Requested amount exceeds the department budget limit."</li>
    </ul>

        <h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Setiap transaksi perubahan data pada sistem wajib merekam log audit secara ketat untuk menjamin ketertelusuran historis:</p>
    
