                    22 => 
                    array (
                        'id' => 108,
                        'code' => 'FSD-076',
                        'title' => 'Month-End Closing Programs',
                        'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Month-End Closing Programs. Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-076.',
                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-23</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Supplier Return (Retur Pembelian)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-17</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Inventory Management / Purchasing</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">2.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul Supplier Return mengelola alur pengembalian barang terstruktur: <strong>PO Return &rarr; Goods Return (GRR) &rarr; Debit Memo &rarr; Realisasi (Offset AP / Incoming Payment)</strong>. Memastikan kontrol kuantitas fisik, pencatatan batch/expiry, dan penjurnalan akuntansi yang presisi.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Procure-to-Pay (P2P) Structured Returns Management.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Pembuatan PO Return (dengan indikator return = true) mengacu pada PO/GR asal atau manual.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Posting dokumen Goods Return / GRR untuk memotong persediaan fisik di gudang.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Pembuatan Debit Memo mengacu pada GRR untuk menerbitkan nota kredit/debit penagihan vendor.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Proses realisasi keuangan (Clearing Offset dengan tagihan AP Invoice atau pencatatan Kas Masuk / Incoming Payment).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Rilis PO Return &rarr; Buat &amp; Post Goods Return (GRR) &rarr; Potong Stok Gudang &rarr; Buat &amp; Post Debit Memo &rarr; Jalankan Proses Realisasi (Offset AP / Incoming Payment).</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar Fiori multitab:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Tab PO Return:</strong> Formulir detail item barang retur, harga beli, dan kuantitas kesepakatan.</li>
        <li><strong>Tab Goods Return (GRR):</strong> Pencatatan fisik pengeluaran barang, nomor batch, expired date, dan Storage Location.</li>
        <li><strong>Tab Finansial:</strong> Jurnal akuntansi yang terbentuk beserta layar alokasi Offset AP Invoice / Cash Receipt.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Spesifikasi field database lengkap untuk modul alur retur pembelian:</p>

    <h3>7.1 Purchase Order Return Header (<code>purchase_orders</code> - Return Indicator)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
