            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">stock_adjustment_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; stock_adjustments)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Menghubungkan baris detail dengan header induk (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang/Gudang penampung fisik barang untuk baris bersangkutan (Wajib terisi di level item).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">storage_location_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; storage_locations)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Zona lokasi fisik penyimpanan barang di gudang (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">item_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; items)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Referensi barang terdaftar yang di-opname (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">batch_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor batch/lot barang (Wajib terisi jika jenis barang bertipe batch-tracked).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">expired_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal expired barang hasil opname.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">book_qty</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas stok persediaan sistem/buku saat di-freeze (Wajib &ge; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">physical_qty</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas fisik riil barang hasil hitung aktual di gudang (Wajib &ge; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">variance_qty</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas selisih opname: <code>physical_qty - book_qty</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">uom_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; uoms)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Satuan transaksi barang yang di-opname.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">unit_cost</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Harga pokok persediaan unit (Moving Average Cost) barang saat inisiasi (Wajib &ge; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deviation_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai deviasi finansial baris: <code>variance_qty * unit_cost</code>.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Kuantitas buku (`book_qty`) dan harga pokok unit (`unit_cost`) terkunci otomatis saat inisiasi pembuatan draf opname.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
    <h3>9.1 Document Flow &amp; Status Matrix</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Awal</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Aksi / Pemicu Transisi</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Akhir</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aturan Bisnis</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DRAFT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kirim Peninjauan Manajer</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>PENDING_APPROVAL</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sistem mengunci pengeditan fisik. Dokumen siap diaudit supervisor.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>PENDING_APPROVAL</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Setujui &amp; Post Stok</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>POSTED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status dikunci. Kartu stok terupdate. Jurnal finansial terposting otomatis ke Buku Besar.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-01 (Approval limit):</strong> Deviasi finansial kumulatif di atas Rp 10.000.000 (atau setara) wajib lolos persetujuan level Manajer Logistik/Keuangan.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-02 (Batch status):</strong> Nomor batch barang bertipe lot-tracked wajib diisi lengkap beserta tanggal expired.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
    <p>Pengubahan status dari <code>PENDING_APPROVAL</code> menjadi <code>POSTED</code> menuntut verifikasi approval limit sesuai peran RBAC pengguna.</p>

    <h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
    <p>User dengan peran <code>LOGISTICS_PLANNER</code> berwenang membuat draf dan mengisi fisik, sedangkan posting akhir diotorisasi oleh <code>LOGISTICS_SUPERVISOR</code> atau <code>ADMIN</code>.</p>

    <h2>13. Notification</h2>
    <p>Notifikasi otomatis dikirimkan ke pihak Keuangan (Finance) jika terjadi posting opname dengan selisih material di atas limit kewajaran.</p>

    <h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>POST /api/stock-adjustments</code> — Membuat draft opname.</li>
        <li><code>POST /api/stock-adjustments/{id}/freeze</code> — Membekukan stok sistem.</li>
        <li><code>POST /api/stock-adjustments/{id}/post</code> — Memposting dokumen penyesuaian stok.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>ERR-OPN-001</code>: Selisih opname memerlukan approval supervisor &rarr; Posting ditolak.</li>
        <li><code>ERR-OPN-002</code>: Kode batch barang tidak valid &rarr; Transaksi diblokir.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
    <p>Setiap log pergantian status opname terekam lengkap pada tabel <code>audit_logs</code>.</p>

    <h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
    <p>Relasi utama pada ERD 00: <code>stock_adjustments</code> (1) &rarr; (N) <code>stock_adjustment_lines</code> &rarr; (1) <code>items</code>.</p>

    <h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
    <p>Inisiasi &rarr; Freeze &rarr; Input Aktual Fisik &rarr; Validasi Otorisasi Limit &rarr; Posting Penyesuaian &rarr; Sukses.</p>

    <h2>19. Test Scenario</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Posting opname dengan deviasi melebihi limit tanpa approval &rarr; Hasil: Sistem menolak transaksi.</li>
        <li>Posting opname dengan selisih positif &rarr; Hasil: Jurnal debit Persediaan (BSX) vs kredit Selisih Opname terposting otomatis.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>20. Future Enhancement</h2>
    <p>Integrasi perangkat scanner genggam nirkabel (handheld scanner) untuk mempermudah entri hasil stock take di lapangan.</p>
