                    'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Laporan Piutang (Report AR). Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-095.',
                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-25</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Stock Transfer (Mutasi Antar Gudang)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-19</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Inventory Management / Stock Movement</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul Stock Transfer mengelola pemindahan stok persediaan baik intra-cabang (antar lokasi penyimpanan) maupun inter-cabang (dua tahap: Goods Issue dan Goods Receipt dengan penampung Stock in Transit) demi menjaga akurasi kartu stok dan pelaporan keuangan persediaan.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Inventory Management: Internal Stock Transfer.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Petugas cabang asal membuat dokumen Stock Transfer baru dan memilih tipe mutasi.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Petugas menambahkan detail item barang, lokasi penyimpanan asal, lokasi tujuan, dan kuantitas.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Petugas memposting pengeluaran (Goods Issue / PGI) untuk memotong stok asal dan memicu jurnal Stock in Transit.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Petugas cabang tujuan memeriksa kiriman transit di menu PGR.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-05:</strong> Petugas cabang tujuan memposting penerimaan (Goods Receipt / PGR) untuk menambah stok tujuan dan menghapus saldo transit.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Inisiasi Rencana Mutasi &rarr; Tentukan Jenis Mutasi (Intra/Inter) &rarr; Input Detail Barang &amp; Lokasi &rarr; Post Goods Issue (PGI) &rarr; Persediaan Masuk SIT &rarr; Post Goods Receipt (PGR) di Cabang Tujuan &rarr; Persediaan Masuk Gudang Penerima &rarr; Selesai.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar Fiori-style dengan susunan:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Header:</strong> Nomor Transfer, Jenis Mutasi, Cabang Asal, Cabang Tujuan, Tanggal Kirim, Tanggal Terima, Status Dokumen.</li>
        <li><strong>Lines:</strong> Tabel barang dengan lokasi asal, lokasi tujuan, nomor batch, tanggal expired, kuantitas mutasi, kuantitas diterima, dan kuantitas sisa transit.</li>
        <li><strong>Audit:</strong> Log pencatatan riwayat tindakan pengguna.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Spesifikasi field database lengkap untuk modul Stock Transfer:</p>

    <h3>7.1 Stock Transfer Header Table (<code>stock_transfers</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">transfer_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor dokumen Stock Transfer unik (Range: <code>5400000000 - 5499999999</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">company_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; companies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID perusahaan induk pemilik transaksi (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">transfer_type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tipe mutasi: <code>INTRA_BRANCH</code> atau <code>INTER_BRANCH</code> (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">from_branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Cabang asal pengirim persediaan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">document_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal fisik penerbitan dokumen transaksi (diperbolehkan tanggal mundur / back-date).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">posting_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal efektif pencatatan transaksi untuk pengakuan jurnal akuntansi Buku Besar (Wajib terisi, dilarang melebihi tanggal berjalan).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">entry_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal dan waktu aktual penginputan dokumen transaksi ke dalam sistem (terisi otomatis saat data disimpan).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">to_branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Cabang tujuan penerima persediaan (Wajib terisi jika tipe <code>INTER_BRANCH</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">ship_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal pengiriman / posting Goods Issue (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">receive_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal penerimaan / posting Goods Receipt di tujuan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">header_text</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TEXT (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Catatan penjelasan tambahan tingkat header dokumen.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status dokumen: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>SHIPPED</code> (Goods Issue selesai), <code>RECEIVED</code> (Goods Receipt selesai), <code>CANCELLED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu pembuatan data.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pembuat dokumen.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">updated_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu modifikasi terakhir data.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">updated_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pengubah data terakhir.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deleted_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Penanda soft delete.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deleted_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pelaku soft delete.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.2 Stock Transfer Lines Table (<code>stock_transfer_lines</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key detail baris.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">stock_transfer_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; stock_transfers)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Menghubungkan baris detail dengan header induk (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">item_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; items)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Referensi barang terdaftar yang dimutasi (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">from_storage_location_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; storage_locations)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Zona lokasi penyimpanan asal di cabang pengirim (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">to_storage_location_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; storage_locations)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Zona lokasi penyimpanan tujuan di cabang penerima (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">batch_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor batch/lot barang (Wajib terisi jika jenis barang bertipe batch-tracked).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">expired_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal expired barang yang dimutasi.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">quantity</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas barang yang dikirimkan (Wajib &gt; 0, divalidasi tidak boleh melebihi stok asal).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">received_qty</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas barang yang diterima di cabang tujuan (Default: 0.0000, diisi saat PGR).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">transit_qty</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas barang yang masih dalam perjalanan: <code>quantity - received_qty</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">uom_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; uoms)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Satuan ukuran mutasi barang (Dapat berupa Alternatif UOM).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">uom_conversion_factor</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Faktor konversi untuk mengalikan kuantitas satuan terima fisik (Alternative UOM) ke kuantitas UOM PO asli (Wajib &gt; 0, default: 1.0000).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Default status dokumen baru adalah <code>DRAFT</code>.</li>
        <li>Tipe mutasi default adalah <code>INTRA_BRANCH</code> jika cabang pengirim dan penerima identik.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
    <h3>9.1 Document Flow &amp; Status Matrix</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Awal</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Aksi / Pemicu Transisi</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Akhir</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aturan Bisnis</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DRAFT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Post Goods Issue (PGI)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>SHIPPED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Stok cabang asal terpotong. Saldo Stock in Transit bertambah. Jurnal terposting otomatis.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>SHIPPED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Post Goods Receipt (PGR)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>RECEIVED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Stok cabang tujuan bertambah. Saldo Stock in Transit berkurang. Jurnal penyesuaian terposting. Dokumen terkunci.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-01 (Stock Check):</strong> PGI hanya dapat diposting jika kuantitas mencukupi pada lokasi penyimpanan asal.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-02 (PGR Limit):</strong> Penerimaan PGR di cabang tujuan tidak boleh melebihi kuantitas kirim PGI (<code>received_qty &le; quantity</code>).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
    <p>Mutasi persediaan tidak memerlukan persetujuan approval bertingkat kecuali terjadi deviasi barang hilang atau rusak selama perjalanan transit.</p>

    <h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
    <p>User dengan peran <code>GR_CLERK</code> di cabang asal berwenang memposting PGI, dan peran <code>GR_CLERK</code> di cabang tujuan berwenang memposting PGR.</p>

    <h2>13. Notification</h2>
    <p>Sistem mengirimkan notifikasi internal otomatis ke cabang tujuan sesaat setelah status dokumen berubah menjadi <code>SHIPPED</code>.</p>

    <h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>POST /api/stock-transfers</code> — Membuat draft dokumen mutasi.</li>
        <li><code>POST /api/stock-transfers/{id}/ship</code> — Memposting Goods Issue (PGI).</li>
        <li><code>POST /api/stock-transfers/{id}/receive</code> — Memposting Goods Receipt (PGR) di cabang tujuan.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>ERR-TRF-001</code>: Stok pengirim tidak mencukupi &rarr; PGI ditolak.</li>
        <li><code>ERR-TRF-002</code>: Kuantitas terima melebihi kuantitas kirim &rarr; PGR diblokir.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
    <p>Setiap pergantian status PGI &amp; PGR terekam otomatis pada tabel log audit terpusat.</p>

    <h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
    <p>Relasi utama pada ERD 00: <code>stock_transfers</code> (1) &rarr; (N) <code>stock_transfer_lines</code> &rarr; (1) <code>items</code>.</p>

    <h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
    <p>Buat Draft &rarr; Post PGI Asal &rarr; Masuk Transit (SIT) &rarr; Post PGR Tujuan &rarr; Masuk Stok Tujuan &rarr; Sukses.</p>

    <h2>19. Test Scenario</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Posting PGR dengan kuantitas melebihi PGI &rarr; Hasil: Sistem menampilkan error <code>ERR-TRF-002</code>.</li>
        <li>Posting PGI inter-cabang &rarr; Hasil: Jurnal debit Stock in Transit vs kredit Persediaan terposting otomatis.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>20. Future Enhancement</h2>
    <p>Integrasi dengan barcode scanner area bongkar muat untuk otomatisasi pemindaian penerimaan mutasi inter-cabang.</p>
</div>',
