                        'title' => 'Laporan AR Aging',
                        'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Laporan AR Aging. Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-097.',
                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-26</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - AP Invoice (Faktur Pembelian)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-20</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Materials Management / Accounts Payable</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">3.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul AP Invoice digunakan untuk mencatatkan tagihan masuk dari supplier berdasarkan dokumen rujukan Goods Receipt (GR) pengiriman barang fisik atau jasa, memverifikasi kecocokan data, dan mengakui kewajiban hutang dagang perusahaan beserta pemotongan pajak WHT terkait.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Procure-to-Pay (P2P): Supplier Invoicing &amp; Liability Recognition.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> AP Staff membuat draf AP Invoice baru dengan merujuk nomor GR.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Sistem menyalin data barang dan kuantitas dari GR, serta harga satuan dari PO (3-way matching).</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> AP Staff menyeleksi kode pajak WHT di header jika terutang PPh Pasal 23/21.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> AP Staff memposting dokumen (POSTED) yang memicu terbentuknya hutang dagang Buku Besar.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Rujuk GR &rarr; Validasi 3-Way Match &rarr; Hitung PPN &amp; WHT &rarr; Input GL Adjustments &rarr; Posting AP Invoice &rarr; Hutang Terbentuk &rarr; Selesai.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar Fiori-style:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Header:</strong> Nomor Invoice, Vendor, Term of Payment, Document Date, Posting Date, Entry Date, Total Gross, Total Tax, Total WHT, Total Net, Status.</li>
        <li><strong>GL Adjustments Tab:</strong> Entri penyesuaian nominal Buku Besar (GL Account, Debit/Credit, Amount, Branch, Cost Center, Tax Code, Text).</li>
        <li><strong>Details Table:</strong> Item, Kuantitas (locked), UOM, Harga Satuan, PPN Code, PPN Amount, Net Line Amount.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    
    <h3>7.1 Supplier Invoice Header Table (<code>supplier_invoices</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">invoice_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor dokumen AP Invoice unik (Range: <code>5100000000 - 5199999999</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">company_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; companies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID perusahaan induk (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Cabang pencatat hutang (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">vendor_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; vendors)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Supplier penagih (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">payment_term_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; payment_terms)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Syarat pembayaran / jangka waktu pelunasan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">currency_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; currencies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Mata uang penagihan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">exchange_rate</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai kurs konversi valas (Wajib terisi, default 1.0000).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">wht_code_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; wht_codes, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kode PPh Pasal 23/21 yang dipotong di header (misal PPh 2%, PPh 10%).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">document_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal fisik invoice yang diterbitkan supplier (dapat backdated).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">posting_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal efektif pencatatan akuntansi ke Buku Besar (tidak boleh melebihi tanggal berjalan).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">due_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal jatuh tempo pembayaran tagihan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">entry_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu aktual data disimpan otomatis.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_gross_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total nilai tagihan kotor sebelum pajak.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_tax_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total nilai PPN Masukan hasil kalkulasi pajak detail.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_wht_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total nominal potongan PPh hasil persentase wht_code_id terhadap nilai DPP.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">total_net_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Total nilai bersih tagihan akhir: <code>gross + tax - WHT</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">outstanding_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sisa saldo hutang yang belum terbayar (dikurangi saat pelunasan).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status tagihan: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>UNPAID</code>, <code>PARTIALLY_PAID</code>, <code>PAID</code>, <code>CANCELLED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">payment_submission_count</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">INT</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Counter pelacakan jumlah pengajuan/realisasi pembayaran. Bertambah +1 jika pelunasan pembayaran sebelumnya di-reverse/dibatalkan sebagai penanda pengajuan ulang (default 0).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.2 Supplier Invoice Lines Table (<code>supplier_invoice_lines</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">supplier_invoice_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; supplier_invoices)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Relasi ke header invoice (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang alokasi item fisik terkait.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">goods_receipt_line_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; goods_receipt_lines)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tautan ke baris detail GR penerimaan barang asal (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">item_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; items)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID barang/jasa yang dibeli.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">quantity</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas barang yang ditagih (Wajib &gt; 0, divalidasi tidak boleh melebihi sisa GR).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">uom_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; uoms)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Satuan ukuran item.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">unit_price</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Harga satuan barang (disalin otomatis dari PO rujukan).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">tax_code_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; tax_codes)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kode PPN Masukan yang berlaku di baris detail.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">tax_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai nominal pajak PPN Masukan detail baris.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">net_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai bersih akhir baris: <code>(quantity * unit_price) + tax_amount</code>.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.3 Supplier Invoice GL Lines Table (<code>supplier_invoice_gl_lines</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key alokasi GL.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">supplier_invoice_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; supplier_invoices)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Relasi ke header invoice.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang alokasi pembebanan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">gl_account_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; coas)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Akun Buku Besar tujuan penyesuaian biaya (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">debit_credit</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(10)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Arah penyesuaian: <code>DEBIT</code> atau <code>CREDIT</code> (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nominal penyesuaian moneter (Wajib &gt; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">cost_center_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; cost_centers, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Pusat Biaya pembebanan jika gl_account_id berupa beban operasional.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">tax_code_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; tax_codes, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kode PPN Masukan jika penyesuaian biaya dikenakan PPN.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">text</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(255)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Keterangan penjelas baris GL (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.4 Supplier Invoice Down Payment Table (<code>supplier_invoice_down_payments</code>)</h3>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Menyimpan informasi penarikan / aplikasi pemotongan uang muka (Down Payment Clearing) yang direalisasikan pada tagihan AP Invoice ini.</p>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key relasi aplikasi uang muka.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">supplier_invoice_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; supplier_invoices)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tautan ke dokumen AP Invoice (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">vendor_down_payment_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; vendor_down_payments)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tautan rujukan dokumen Uang Muka Vendor yang direalisasikan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">applied_amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nominal saldo uang muka yang dikompensasikan untuk mengurangi tagihan ini (Wajib &gt; 0, tidak boleh melebihi outstanding_balance uang muka atau total gross invoice).</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Default status tagihan baru adalah <code>DRAFT</code>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
    <h3>9.1 Document Flow &amp; Status Matrix</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Awal</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Aksi / Pemicu Transisi</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Akhir</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aturan Bisnis</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DRAFT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Posting Faktur</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>UNPAID</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jurnal terbentuk: Debit GR/IR Clearing/Biaya vs Kredit Hutang Dagang (AP) + WHT Payable.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>9.2 Realisasi Uang Muka (Down Payment Clearing Jurnal)</h2>
    <p>Apabila AP Invoice merujuk pada PO yang memiliki Uang Muka Vendor terbayar, sistem mengizinkan realisasi pemotongan uang muka (clearing). Dampak jurnal akuntansi saat posting adalah:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Debit: Beban / Persediaan (atau GR/IR Clearing) — Sebesar total gross tagihan.</li>
        <li>Kredit: Piutang Uang Muka Supplier — Sebesar nominal uang muka yang direalisasikan (applied_amount).</li>
        <li>Kredit: Hutang Dagang (AP) — Sebesar sisa nilai tagihan bersih yang masih harus dibayar.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-03 (Down Payment Clearing Limit):</strong> Nominal uang muka yang diaplikasikan (<code>applied_amount</code>) dilarang melebihi sisa saldo terbuka uang muka (<code>vendor_down_payments.outstanding_balance</code>) dan dilarang melebihi total tagihan kotor AP Invoice.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-01 (GR Qty Limit):</strong> Kuantitas penagihan AP Invoice tidak boleh melampaui sisa kuantitas barang yang diterima pada GR.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-02 (Chronological Validation):</strong> Tanggal posting tagihan wajib memenuhi: <code>supplier_invoices.posting_date &ge; goods_receipts.posting_date</code> (tanggal PGR) dan <code>supplier_invoices.posting_date &le; CURRENT_DATE</code>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
    <p>Pencatatan AP Invoice standard tidak memerlukan matriks approval bertingkat kecuali jika terdapat variasi selisih harga dari PO.</p>

    <h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
    <p>Entri dikelola oleh peran <code>AP_CLERK</code>, sedangkan otorisasi posting akhir dipegang oleh <code>FINANCE_SUPERVISOR</code>.</p>

    <h2>13. Notification</h2>
    <p>Notifikasi tagihan tempo dikirim ke bagian pembendaharaan sebelum tanggal jatuh tempo.</p>

    <h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>POST /api/supplier-invoices</code> — Membuat draf AP Invoice baru.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>ERR-AP-001</code>: Kuantitas tagih melebihi GR &rarr; Transaksi diblokir.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
    <p>Log audit merekam nama operator penginput, supervisor penanda posting, dan tanggal entry_date.</p>

    <h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
    <p>Relasi utama pada ERD 00: <code>supplier_invoices</code> (1) &rarr; (N) <code>supplier_invoice_lines</code> &rarr; (1) <code>goods_receipt_lines</code>.</p>

    <h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
    <p>Ambil GR &rarr; Validasi 3-Way Match &rarr; Posting Invoice &rarr; Jurnal Terposting &rarr; Sukses.</p>

    <h2>19. Test Scenario</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Posting tagihan dengan kuantitas melebihi GR &rarr; Hasil: Sistem menolak dengan error <code>ERR-AP-001</code>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>20. Future Enhancement</h2>
    <p>Integrasi fitur OCR scan otomatis untuk mencocokkan fisik faktur supplier secara digital.</p>
</div>',
