                    'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Laporan Purchase Order (PO Report). Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-085.',
                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-28</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - General Ledger (Memorial Journal)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-22</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">General Ledger / Finance</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul Memorial Journal menyediakan fungsi bagi staf akuntansi untuk menginput transaksi penyesuaian double-entry manual ke akun Buku Besar, memvalidasi keseimbangan Debit-Kredit secara real-time, dan mengalokasikan beban biaya ke Cabang dan Cost Center.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>General Ledger: Manual Journal Entries &amp; Period End Adjustments.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Accounting Staff membuat draf dokumen Memorial Journal baru.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Staff mengisi document_date and posting_date, serta total deskripsi umum jurnal.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Staff menambahkan baris detail berisi gl_account_id, debit_credit indicator, amount, branch_id, dan cost_center_id.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Sistem memvalidasi keabsahan data, keseimbangan Debit/Kredit, dan status periode akuntansi.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-05:</strong> Finance Manager memposting draf (POSTED) yang langsung memperbarui neraca saldo Buku Besar.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Buat Draf &rarr; Input Atribut Header &rarr; Input Baris Detail (Debit/Kredit) &rarr; Validasi Keseimbangan &amp; Akun Kontrol &rarr; Approval/Posting &rarr; Jurnal Terposting &rarr; Selesai.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar Fiori-style:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Header:</strong> Nomor Jurnal, Document Date, Posting Date, Entry Date (ReadOnly), Total Debit, Total Kredit, Selisih (wajib 0), Keterangan, Status.</li>
        <li><strong>Lines Table:</strong> Kolom pilihan Akun G/L, Jenis Posting (Debit/Kredit), Nominal Nilai (Amount), Cabang (Branch), Pusat Biaya (Cost Center), Keterangan Baris.</li>
        <li><strong>Audit Tab:</strong> Menampilkan log pencatatan riwayat perubahan data jurnal.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4">Spesifikasi field database lengkap untuk modul Jurnal Memorial:</p>

    <h3>7.1 Memorial Journal Header Table (<code>journal_entries</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
