            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key detail baris.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">journal_entry_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; journal_entries)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Menghubungkan baris detail dengan header jurnal memorial induk (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Cabang alokasi pembebanan saldo (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">gl_account_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; coas)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Akun Buku Besar tujuan penyesuaian (Wajib terisi, tipe POSTING, dilarang berupa akun kontrol).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">gl_account_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; coas, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Akun Buku Besar tujuan penyesuaian (Wajib terisi jika bukan posting subledger, dilarang berupa akun kontrol secara langsung).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">subledger_type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jenis sub-ledger jika penyesuaian melibatkan akun pembantu: <code>CUSTOMER</code> atau <code>VENDOR</code>.</td></tr>
