                    'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Kartu Stok (Stock Card). Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-088.',
                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-31</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Request for Quotation (RFQ)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-53</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Materials Management / Procurement</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul RFQ memfasilitasi pembuatan draf penawaran, penentuan daftar item rujukan PR, pemilihan vendor yang akan diundang, dan penentuan batas waktu respon penawaran dari vendor.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Procure-to-Pay (P2P): Request for Quotation &amp; Supplier Invitation.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Buyer membuat draf RFQ baru dan mengaitkannya dengan PR.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Buyer menyeleksi dan menambahkan beberapa vendor terdaftar ke dokumen RFQ.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Buyer menentukan batas tanggal pengajuan penawaran (deadline_date).</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Buyer memposting RFQ (SENT). Sistem menerbitkan file PDF kompilasi spesifikasi barang untuk dikirim ke vendor.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Buat RFQ &rarr; Rujuk PR &rarr; Pilih Vendor &rarr; Tentukan Deadline &rarr; Kirim RFQ &rarr; Terima Surat Penawaran Vendor &rarr; Selesai.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Header Info:</strong> Nomor RFQ, PR Ref, Company, Branch, Document Date, Deadline Date, Status.</li>
        <li><strong>Items Table:</strong> Daftar item barang/jasa, spesifikasi deskripsi, kuantitas kebutuhan, satuan ukuran.</li>
        <li><strong>Vendors List Table:</strong> Kolom pilihan Vendor, Nomor Kontak, Status Respon, Nomor Penawaran Terdaftar.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    
    <h3>7.1 RFQ Header Table (<code>request_for_quotations</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">rfq_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor dokumen RFQ unik (Range: <code>5300000000 - 5399999999</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">purchase_requisition_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; purchase_requisitions, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tautan ke dokumen PR asal.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">company_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; companies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID perusahaan induk (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Cabang penerbit RFQ (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">document_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal pembuatan dokumen fisik RFQ.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deadline_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Batas waktu akhir pengajuan penawaran dari vendor (Wajib terisi, &ge; document_date).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">entry_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal aktual penyimpanan data sistem.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status dokumen: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>SENT</code>, <code>CLOSED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu pembuatan data.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pembuat voucher.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">updated_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu modifikasi terakhir data.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">updated_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pengubah data terakhir.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deleted_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Penanda soft delete.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">deleted_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pelaku soft delete.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.2 RFQ Items Table (<code>request_for_quotation_lines</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key item.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">request_for_quotation_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; request_for_quotations)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Relasi ke header RFQ induk (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">item_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; items)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID barang/jasa yang diminta (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">quantity</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jumlah kuantitas kebutuhan penawaran (Wajib &gt; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">uom_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; uoms)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Satuan ukuran item (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">notes</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(255) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Keterangan/spesifikasi khusus detail item.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.3 RFQ Invited Vendors Table (<code>request_for_quotation_vendors</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key daftar vendor rujukan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">request_for_quotation_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; request_for_quotations)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Relasi ke header RFQ induk (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">vendor_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; vendors)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Vendor terpilih untuk diundang (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">quotation_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor surat penawaran masuk dari vendor jika sudah disubmit (Diisi manual oleh buyer).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">quotation_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal surat penawaran masuk dari vendor.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status respon vendor: <code>INVITED</code>, <code>SUBMITTED</code>, <code>DECLINED</code>.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Status dokumen default: <code>DRAFT</code>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
    <h3>9.1 Document Flow &amp; Status Matrix</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Awal</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Aksi / Pemicu Transisi</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Akhir</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aturan Bisnis</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DRAFT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kirim Ke Vendor</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>SENT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Sistem mengunci data RFQ. Tanggal pengajuan penawaran resmi dimulai.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-01 (Deadline Date Logic):</strong> Batas tanggal penawaran (`deadline_date`) dilarang lebih kecil dari `document_date`.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-02 (PR Consolidation Qty):</strong> Jumlah kuantitas penawaran di baris detail RFQ dilarang melebihi sisa kuantitas PR terbuka yang dikonsolidasikan.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
    <p>RFQ memerlukan approval dari Purchasing Supervisor sebelum dapat dikirim (SENT) ke vendor.</p>

    <h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
    <p>Pembuatan dilakukan oleh peran <code>BUYER</code>, dan otorisasi kirim dikelola oleh <code>PROCUREMENT_SUPERVISOR</code>.</p>

    <h2>13. Notification</h2>
    <p>Notifikasi sistem mengingatkan buyer 1 hari sebelum deadline_date jika masih ada vendor yang belum mengirim respon.</p>

    <h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>POST /api/request-for-quotations</code> — Membuat draf RFQ baru.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>ERR-RFQ-001</code>: Tanggal tenggat tidak valid &rarr; Validasi ditolak.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
    <p>Mencatat riwayat nama vendor yang diundang dan waktu input dokumen respon penawaran.</p>

    <h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
    <p>Relasi utama pada ERD 00: <code>request_for_quotations</code> (1) &rarr; (N) <code>request_for_quotation_lines</code> &rarr; (1) <code>items</code>.</p>

    <h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
    <p>Buyer Buat RFQ &rarr; Pilih Vendor &rarr; Kirim Dokumen &rarr; Input Respon Vendor &rarr; Hubungkan ke QCF &rarr; Sukses.</p>

