                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-34</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Vendor Down Payment (Uang Muka Vendor)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-56</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Materials Management / Accounts Payable</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul ini menangani pencatatan dan jurnal pengeluaran kas untuk uang muka pembelian barang/jasa kepada vendor (Vendor Down Payment) berdasarkan PO, serta melacak pemakaian saldo uang muka tersebut saat offsetting tagihan.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Procure-to-Pay (P2P): Supplier Prepayments &amp; AP Clearing.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> AP Staff membuat dokumen Uang Muka baru dengan merujuk nomor PO.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Staff menginput nominal uang muka, memilih rekening bank, dan menentukan persentase pajak PPN Masukan atas uang muka.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Staff memposting dokumen (POSTED), menerbitkan jurnal Buku Besar dan mencatatkan saldo piutang uang muka kerja.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Sistem memperbarui nilai saldo terbuka uang muka (`outstanding_balance`) yang siap dialokasikan pada AP Invoice.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Rujuk PO &rarr; Input Nominal Uang Muka &rarr; Hitung PPN Masukan &rarr; Posting Pembayaran DP &rarr; Jurnal Terbit (Piutang Uang Muka vs Kas/Bank) &rarr; Saldo DP Aktif &rarr; Selesai.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar Fiori-style:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Header Info:</strong> Nomor Bukti DP, PO Reference, Vendor, Rekening Bank, Document Date, Posting Date, Entry Date, Currency, Exchange Rate, Status.</li>
        <li><strong>Pricing Panel:</strong> Nominal Uang Muka (Gross DP), Tax Code (PPN Masukan), Nominal PPN, Nilai Bersih DP (Net DP), Sisa Saldo DP Terbuka (Outstanding Balance).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    
    <h3>7.1 Vendor Down Payment Header Table (<code>vendor_down_payments</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
