                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-37</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Manual Bank Statement (Rekening Koran Manual)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-58</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Financial Accounting / Cash &amp; Bank</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Modul Manual Bank Statement digunakan oleh staf Treasury untuk mencatat mutasi rekening koran fisik secara manual ke sistem dan memproses rekonsiliasi/kliring terhadap transaksi Kas/Bank Buku Besar perusahaan.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Financial Closing: Bank Reconciliation Statement.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Treasury Staff membuat dokumen Bank Statement baru untuk rekening tertentu.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Staff menginput saldo awal, saldo akhir, dan daftar baris mutasi debit/kredit bank.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Staff menekan tombol "Reconcile" untuk mencocokkan baris mutasi bank dengan transaksi internal (Customer Payment / Vendor Payment / Jurnal).</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Setelah semua mutasi kliring seimbang, status rekening koran berubah menjadi RECONCILED.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Buat Rekening Koran &rarr; Input Saldo &amp; Baris Mutasi &rarr; Cari Dokumen Akuntansi Internal &rarr; Lakukan Matching/Clearing &rarr; Verifikasi Selisih &rarr; Reconciled &rarr; Selesai.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar Fiori-style:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Header:</strong> Nomor Statement, Bank Account, Tanggal Koran, Saldo Awal, Saldo Akhir, Total Mutasi Masuk, Total Mutasi Keluar, Status.</li>
        <li><strong>Statement Lines Table:</strong> Booking Date, Value Date, Tipe Mutasi (Debit/Kredit), Nominal Mutasi, Ref Nomor Transfer, Deskripsi Koran, Status Kliring, Dokumen Kliring Internal.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    
    <h3>7.1 Bank Statement Header Table (<code>bank_statements</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
