            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key baris mutasi.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">bank_statement_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; bank_statements)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Relasi ke header statement induk (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">booking_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal pembukuan transaksi oleh pihak bank (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">value_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal efektif mutasi dana mengendap (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">transaction_type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(10)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Arah dana: <code>DEBIT</code> (uang keluar) atau <code>CREDIT</code> (uang masuk).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">amount</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai nominal transaksi mutasi (Wajib &gt; 0).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">reference_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor referensi / slip transfer unik dari bank.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">description</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(255) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Keterangan berita acara / memo transfer bank koran.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">clearing_status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status kliring: <code>OPEN</code> (belum rekonsiliasi) atau <code>CLEARED</code> (sudah kliring).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">cleared_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu rekonsiliasi dilakukan.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">cleared_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User eksekutor rekonsiliasi.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">clearing_document_type</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50) (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tipe dokumen rujukan internal (misal: <code>CUSTOMER_PAYMENT</code>, <code>VENDOR_PAYMENT</code>, <code>JOURNAL_ENTRY</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">clearing_document_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID dokumen akuntansi internal yang dicocokkan.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>8. Default Behaviour</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Mutasi bank berstatus default <code>OPEN</code> dan siap di-match dengan data kas Buku Besar internal.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Functional Rules</h2>
    <h3>9.1 Document Flow &amp; Status Matrix</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Awal</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Aksi / Pemicu Transisi</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Status Akhir</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aturan Bisnis</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>DRAFT</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Posting Rekening Koran</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>POSTED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Mengunci data entri mutasi. Program pencocokan rekonsiliasi dapat dimulai.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>POSTED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Selesaikan Kliring</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>RECONCILED</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Seluruh baris mutasi bank berhasil dicocokkan (CLEARED) dengan selisih nol.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>10. Validation Rules</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>VAL-01 (Starting Balance Verification):</strong> Nilai <code>starting_balance</code> wajib sama dengan <code>ending_balance</code> dari dokumen statement sebelumnya yang berstatus POSTED/RECONCILED untuk akun bank yang sama.</li>
        <li><strong>VAL-02 (Closing Verification Formula):</strong> Dokumen dilarang di-reconciled jika formula berikut tidak seimbang: <code>starting_balance + total_credits - total_debits &ne; ending_balance</code>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>11. Workflow (Approval Matrix)</h2>
    <p>Pernyataan rekonsiliasi bank akhir bulan ditinjau oleh Finance Supervisor dan ditandatangani oleh Finance Manager.</p>

    <h2>12. Authorization Matrix</h2>
    <p>Pencatatan dikelola oleh <code>TREASURY_CLERK</code>, sedangkan otorisasi kliring/closing disetujui oleh <code>FINANCE_SUPERVISOR</code>.</p>

    <h2>13. Notification</h2>
    <p>Sistem mengirimkan notifikasi harian ke tim kasir jika terdapat mutasi kredit besar di bank (incoming transfer) yang belum teridentifikasi (*unapplied cash*).</p>

    <h2>14. API / Interface Detail</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>POST /api/bank-statements</code> — Membuat draf rekening koran baru.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>15. Error Handling</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><code>ERR-BS-001</code>: Saldo awal tidak berurutan &rarr; Validasi gagal.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>16. Audit Trail</h2>
    <p>Merekam log detail pencocokan, tanggal kliring, nama user eksekutor, serta riwayat pembatalan kliring.</p>

    <h2>17. Data Mapping (ERD)</h2>
    <p>Relasi utama pada ERD 00: <code>bank_statements</code> (1) &rarr; (N) <code>bank_statement_lines</code> &rarr; (1) <code>bank_accounts</code>.</p>

    <h2>18. Sequence Diagram (High Level)</h2>
    <p>Input Koran &rarr; Cari Pembayaran internal &rarr; Lakukan Matching &rarr; Update Status Cleared &rarr; Finalisasi &rarr; Sukses.</p>

    <h2>19. Test Scenario</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Menginput `starting_balance` berbeda dengan saldo akhir statement sebelumnya &rarr; Hasil: Tampil error <code>ERR-BS-001</code>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>20. Future Enhancement</h2>
    <p>Integrasi format standard pembacaan data e-Banking MT940 / CAMT.053 untuk auto-upload dan auto-matching berbasis AI.</p>
</div>',
                        'status' => 'Under Review',
                        'created_at' => '2026-07-18 13:32:07',
                        'updated_at' => '2026-07-18 13:35:20',
                    ),
