                    array (
                        'id' => 124,
                        'code' => 'FSD-057',
                    'title' => 'Setup Master Harga Jual (Sales Price List)',
                    'description' => 'Spesifikasi fungsional untuk Setup Master Harga Jual (Sales Price List). Mengacu pada dokumen BRD-057.',
                        'content' => '<div class="prose max-w-none prose-sm text-justify">
    <h2>1. Document Information</h2>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4">
        <tbody>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4 bg-gray-100">FSD Code</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">FSD-39</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Title</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Functional Specification - Foreign Exchange Revaluation (Revaluasi Kurs Bulanan)</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Reference BRD</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">BRD-59</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Module</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">Financial Accounting / GL &amp; Valuta Asing</td></tr>
            <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100">Version</th><td class="border px-2 py-1">1.0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Functional Overview</h2>
    <p>Spesifikasi fungsional untuk sistem revaluasi saldo terbuka valas pada akhir bulan (AR Invoices, AP Invoices, Rekening Bank Valas) untuk menghitung Unrealized Gain/Loss, memposting jurnal penyesuaian akrual, dan memproses pembalikan jurnal (Auto-Reversal) di awal periode akuntansi berikutnya.</p>

    <h2>3. Business Process Reference</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Financial Month-End Closing: Foreign Exchange Valuation &amp; Adjustment Journaling.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Use Case</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>UC-01:</strong> Finance Controller membuka menu Foreign Exchange Revaluation.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-02:</strong> Controller memilih Periode Akuntansi bulanan yang akan ditutup.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-03:</strong> Sistem menampilkan data kurs penutupan BI yang berlaku. Controller menekan "Calculate Revaluation".</li>
        <li><strong>UC-04:</strong> Sistem menyaring semua saldo valas terbuka dan memunculkan rincian nilai Unrealized Gain/Loss.</li>
        <li><strong>UC-05:</strong> Controller menekan "Post Revaluation Adjustment". Sistem memposting jurnal penyesuaian akhir bulan dan membuat draf jurnal pembalik otomatis bertanggal 1 di periode berikutnya.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Functional Flow</h2>
    <p>Pilih Periode &rarr; Ambil Kurs Penutupan &rarr; Scan Saldo Terbuka Valas &rarr; Hitung Selisih Kurs &rarr; Setujui Revaluasi &rarr; Posting Jurnal Penyesuaian &rarr; Generate Auto-Reversal &rarr; Selesai.</p>

    <h2>6. Screen Specification (UI/Wireframe)</h2>
    <p>Layar Fiori-style:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Header Panel:</strong> Nomor Dokumen Revaluasi, Periode Akuntansi, Tanggal Revaluasi, Status, Tombol "Execute calculation".</li>
        <li><strong>Revaluation Lines Table:</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>Jenis Dokumen (AR / AP / Bank), Nomor Referensi, Nama Pelanggan/Supplier/Akun Bank, Mata Uang, Saldo Terbuka (Valas), Kurs Asal Transaksi, Kurs Penutupan Bulan, Nilai Rupiah Awal, Nilai Rupiah Baru, Selisih Laba/Rugi Belum Terealisasi (Rupiah).</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Action Panel:</strong> Tombol "Post Adjustment JNL" (Memerlukan otorisasi Level Manager).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Field Specification</h2>
    
    <h3>7.1 Forex Revaluation Header Table (<code>forex_revaluations</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1">Validation &amp; Rules</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">revaluation_number</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30) (Unique)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor transaksi revaluasi unik (Range: <code>6200000000 - 6299999999</code>).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">company_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; companies)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID perusahaan induk (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; branches)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID Cabang pembukuan (Wajib terisi).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">accounting_period_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; accounting_periods)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Periode akuntansi yang direvaluasi.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">revaluation_date</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal eksekusi revaluasi (Wajib terisi, tanggal akhir bulan).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">journal_entry_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; journal_entries, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Rujukan jurnal penyesuaian yang terposting otomatis.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">reversal_journal_entry_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; journal_entries, Nullable)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Rujukan jurnal pembalik tanggal 1 periode berikutnya.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status dokumen: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>POSTED</code>, <code>REVERSED</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_at</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Waktu pembuatan data.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">created_by</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; users)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">ID User pembuat dokumen.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>7.2 Forex Revaluation Details Table (<code>forex_revaluation_lines</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
