            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">status</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(30)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Status rekor: <code>DRAFT</code>, <code>ACTIVE</code>, <code>INACTIVE</code>.</td></tr>
