            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">purchase_condition_record_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK &rarr; purchase_condition_records)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Relasi ke record master harga beli parent (Cascade on delete).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">minimum_quantity</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kuantitas minimum pembelian untuk memicu tingkat skala harga/diskon ini.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-mono">rate</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,4)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai nominal diskon (IDR) atau persentase (%) sesuai tipe perhitungan pada parent.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

<h3>7.3 Detail Tingkat Diskon Bertingkat Pembelian (<code>purchase_condition_tiers</code>)</h3>
    <table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
            <tr>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Field Name</th>
                <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Data Type &amp; Key</th>
