        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>GET</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>/admin/currencies</code></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Akses DataTables dan View untuk Master Mata Uang.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>POST</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>/admin/currencies</code></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Pembuatan data Master Mata Uang.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>POST</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>/admin/currencies/{id}/set-base</code></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Endpoint spesifik (Custom Action) untuk men-<em>trigger</em> pergantian tunggal Base Currency secara terpusat.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>GET</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>/admin/exchange-rates</code></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Akses DataTables dan View Histori Kurs.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>GET</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>/api/v1/exchange-rate/current?from=USD&to=IDR&type=CORPORATE&date=2024-05-15</code></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">API krusial yang di-hit oleh *frontend* Sales/PO untuk mendatangkan angka kurs secara otomatis (Fallback logic) pada waktu pembuatan transaksi.</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>5. Technical Validation Rules</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4 border">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr>
            <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Controller Validation</th>
            <th class="border px-2 py-1">Logika FormRequest</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Currency Code Rule</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>\'code\' => \'required|string|size:3|regex:/^[A-Z]{3}$/|unique:currencies,code,\' . $this->id</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Rate Input Rule</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>\'rate\' => \'required|numeric|min:0.000001\'</code><br><code>\'valid_from\' => \'required|date\'</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Logic Self-Exchange</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Validasi kustom: menolak jika <code>from_currency_id</code> == <code>to_currency_id</code>. (Nilai kurs ke mata uang yang sama selalu mutlak 1, tidak perlu disimpan di database histori).</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>6. System Triggers & Observers</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4 border">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr>
            <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/3">Event / Trigger</th>
            <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aksi Otomatis Backend</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Currency - Saving Observer</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Jika model Currency disimpan dengan <code>is_base_currency = 1</code>, maka jalankan DB transaction: <code>Currency::where(\'id\', \'!=\', $model->id)->update([\'is_base_currency\' => 0]);</code> untuk memastikan keutuhan aturan Single Base Currency.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Exchange Rate - Creating Hook</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Melakukan validasi servis internal terhadap status <em>Open/Close Period</em>. Jika <code>valid_from</code> mengarah pada <em>fiscal period</em> yang sudah terkunci, lemparkan <code>ValidationException</code>.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Audit Population</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Injeksi <code>created_by</code>, <code>updated_by</code>, <code>deleted_by</code> pada tiap siklus standar Eloquent.</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>',
