<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>amount_local</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DECIMAL(18,2)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nilai di-*convert* ke mata uang dasar</td></tr>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>item_text</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR, NULLABLE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Keterangan per baris</td></tr>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>tax_code_id</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT, FK NULLABLE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tagihan Pajak (Opsional)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>cost_center_id</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT, FK NULLABLE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Alokasi Biaya</td></tr>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>clearing_document_id</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT, FK NULLABLE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nomor pembayaran/penyelesaian (Self Ref)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>clearing_date</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">DATE, NULLABLE</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tanggal pelunasan</td></tr>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>created_at</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">TIMESTAMP</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Audit Trail</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>3. UI/UX Specifications (Blade MVC)</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
<thead class="bg-gray-100">
<tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Komponen UI</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Metode Implementasi (Non-Filament)</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-bold">Manual Journal Form</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Layar master-detail menggunakan perulangan Alpine.js untuk dinamisasi baris Line Item. Sistem interaktif akan menunjukkan "Total Debit", "Total Kredit", dan kalkulasi "Selisih" di layar secara *real-time* via Alpine reactive binding.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-bold">General Ledger Line View</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Tabel view besar menggunakan DataTables yang menampilkan relasi baris item dan Header-nya.</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>4. API Endpoints</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
<thead class="bg-gray-100">
<tr><th class="border px-2 py-1">Method</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Endpoint</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Fungsi Internal</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">POST</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>/api/accounting/documents/post</code></td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Pintu gerbang untuk membuat jurnal (baik manual dari UI maupun tembakan API dari sistem Logistik). Wajib dibungkus dalam *DB Transaction*.</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>5. Technical Validation Rules</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
<thead class="bg-gray-100">
<tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Controller Validation</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Logika FormRequest</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-bold">Balance Validation</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Melakukan iterasi `foreach ($request->items)` menjumlah array berindikator `D` dan dikurangi `C`. Exception jika hasil !== 0.00.</td></tr>
<tr><td class="border px-2 py-1 font-bold">Line Items Format</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">`\'items\' => \'required|array|min:2\'`</td></tr>
