        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (PK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Auto-increment primary key.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">company_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Relasi ke companies.id. Nullable: False.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">branch_id</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">BIGINT (FK)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Relasi ke branches.id. Nullable: True (Jika null, berlaku untuk seluruh cabang).</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">code</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(20)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Kode identifikasi dokumen (Misal: PO_STD). Kombinasi unique dengan company_id.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">name</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(100)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Nama representatif (Misal: Standard Purchase Order).</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">module</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Modul aplikasi (ENUM/String: Purchasing, Sales, Finance, dll).</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">prefix</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">VARCHAR(50)</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Konfigurasi awalan nomor (Bisa dinamis: {YYYY}, {MM}).</td></tr>
