        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Create/Edit Form</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Form Input standar. Terdapat pratinjau (*preview*) formasi *Prefix* (Misalnya user input `INV/{YYYY}/`, sistem akan merender `INV/2026/00001` sebagai contoh preview).</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>4. API Endpoints</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/6">Method</th><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Endpoint</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Fungsi Internal</th></tr>
