    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Code & Company Uniqueness</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>Rule::unique(\'document_types\')->where(\'company_id\', $req->company_id)</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Number Range Limits</td><td class="border px-2 py-1"><code>\'number_range_end\' => \'required|numeric|gt:number_range_start\'</code></td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>6. System Triggers & Observers</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-xs mb-6 border">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr><th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Event / Trigger</th><th class="border px-2 py-1">Aksi Otomatis Backend</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Model Deleting</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Jika <code>current_number > number_range_start</code> (sudah dipakai), `Exception` dilemparkan dan `delete()` diblokir.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="border px-2 py-1">Model Creating</td><td class="border px-2 py-1">Mengisi `current_number` awal dengan nilai dari `number_range_start` dikurangi 1.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>',
