<h2>5. Technical Validation Rules</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4 border">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr>
            <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/4">Controller Validation</th>
            <th class="border px-2 py-1">Logika FormRequest</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Self-Reference Block</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Persis seperti Chart of Accounts (COA), saat grup disimpan, pastikan <code>parent_id != id</code> untuk menghindari loop tanpa akhir.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Root Deletion Protection</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Grup yang menjadi <em>Root</em> (di mana <code>parent_id</code> = NULL) DILARANG KERAS DIHAPUS (*Delete Blocked*) jika area tersebut masih memiliki entitas perusahaan yang ter-<em>assign</em>.</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>6. System Triggers & Observers</h2>
<table class="min-w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse text-sm mb-4 border">
    <thead class="bg-gray-100">
        <tr>
            <th class="border px-2 py-1 w-1/3">Event / Trigger</th>
            <th class="border px-2 py-1">Aksi Otomatis Backend</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1"><strong>Auto-Seed Root Node</strong></td>
            <td class="border px-2 py-1">Setiap kali sebuah entitas <code>controlling_areas</code> baru diciptakan, *Observer/Service* secara otomatis (di *background*) langsung mencetakkan 1 baris ke tabel <code>cost_center_groups</code> bernama "Standard Hierarchy Root" (sebagai puncak piramida) agar <em>Tree</em> tidak kosong.</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>',
